{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FnXenZhPkBfUxqZxaCqppw","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"tail-384 × Qwen-7B\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"Qwen-2.5-Coder-7B full_trace tail-384 tokens SFT，精确定位 256→512 phase transition 左边界\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"accuracy\": 0.795,\n7\t      \"accuracy_ci_lower\": 0.772,\n8\t      \"accuracy_ci_upper\": 0.818,\n9\t      \"majority_baseline\": 0.7151,\n10\t      \"lift_over_majority_pp\": 8.0,\n11\t      \"pass_f1\": 0.849,\n12\t      \"fail_f1\": 0.682,\n13\t      \"diff_vs_tail256_pp\": 2.0,\n14\t      \"mcnemar_vs_tail256_p\": 0.15,\n15\t      \"diff_vs_tail512_pp\": -14.1\n16\t    },\n17\t    \"tables\": [\n18\t      {\n19\t        \"name\": \"Qwen-7B tail budget curve (complete)\",\n20\t        \"rows\": [\n21\t          {\n22\t            \"tokens\": 256,\n23\t            \"accuracy\": \"77.5%\",\n24\t            \"regime\": \"pre-transition plateau\"\n25\t          },\n26\t          {\n27\t            \"tokens\": 384,\n28\t            \"accuracy\": \"79.5% (pred)\",\n29\t            \"regime\": \"pre-transition plateau\"\n30\t          },\n31\t          {\n32\t            \"tokens\": 512,\n33\t            \"accuracy\": \"93.6%\",\n34\t            \"regime\": \"post-transition rise\"\n35\t          },\n36\t          {\n37\t            \"tokens\": 1024,\n38\t            \"accuracy\": \"96.5%\",\n39\t            \"regime\": \"ceiling plateau\"\n40\t          },\n41\t          {\n42\t            \"tokens\": 2048,\n43\t            \"accuracy\": \"97.3%\",\n44\t            \"regime\": \"ceiling plateau\"\n45\t          }\n46\t        ]\n47\t      }\n48\t    ],\n49\t    \"figures\": [],\n50\t    \"analysis\": \"256→384 Δ=2.0pp vs 384→512 Δ=14.1pp，gradient ratio ~7:1。\\n384 是 \\\"sharp cliff 的左脚\\\"——phase transition 的数学定义要求存在一个 token budget t*\\n使得 accuracy(t*-ε) ≈ accuracy(t*-2ε) 但 accuracy(t*+ε) >> accuracy(t*)。\\n384 的数据精确刻画了这个 t* ≈ 400-450 的位置。\\n\\n\\nQwen-7B tail-256 = 77.48%。384 tokens 仅多 128 tokens（约 6-8 行代码）。trace 末尾的 diagnostic 信号分布呈高度右偏：\\nexception trace 的核心内容（[ERROR] type + message + traceback 最后几帧）集中在 trace 的最后 400-500 tokens。\\n在 384 token 窗口下，仅有少数 \\\"短 exception\\\"（如单行 AssertionError）的样本能被完整捕获，\\n大多数样本的 exception 信息仍被截断或完全缺失。因此 accuracy 仅小幅提升 ~2pp。\\nMcNemar p>0.1 说明提升在统计上不显著——384 和 256 处于同一个 \\\"insufficient signal\\\" regime。\\n这与 information density 假说一致：trace 末尾的 marginal information 在 384 之前主要是 loop 尾部和 assertion 结构的碎片，\\n尚未到达 exception 信号的密集区，因此 accuracy 曲线保持 flat。\\n\"\n51\t  },\n52\t  {\n53\t    \"name\": \"tail-384 × Qwen-1.5B\",\n54\t    \"description\": \"Qwen-2.5-Coder-1.5B full_trace tail-384 tokens SFT\",\n55\t    \"results\": {\n56\t      \"accuracy\": 0.748,\n57\t      \"accuracy_ci_lower\": 0.722,\n58\t      \"accuracy_ci_upper\": 0.773,\n59\t      \"majority_baseline\": 0.7151,\n60\t      \"lift_over_majority_pp\": 3.3,\n61\t      \"diff_vs_tail256_pp\": 2.2,\n62\t      \"mcnemar_vs_tail256_p\": 0.12,\n63\t      \"diff_vs_tail512_pp\": -20.8\n64\t    },\n65\t    \"tables\": [],\n66\t    \"figures\": [],\n67\t    \"analysis\": \"1.5B 的 pre-transition→post-transition jump 是 4 模型中最大的（72.6%→95.6% = 23.0pp），\\n因为它在 pre-transition 区间最差（最小模型最不耐 noise），但在 post-transition 区间并不落后。\\n这放大了 phase transition 的 visual contrast，使 S-curve 最为陡峭。\\n\\n\\nQwen-1.5B tail-256 = 72.6%，甚至低于 majority baseline（71.5%），lift CI 跨 0。\\n更小模型在 insufficient signal 条件下表现更差——1.5B 的 attention capacity 有限，\\n在信号被 noise 淹没时无法有效 extract 任何 useful pattern。384 tokens 同样 signal-insufficient，\\naccuracy 仅提升到 ~74.8%。然而 1.5B 在 tail-512 时跳到 95.6%（高于 7B 的 93.6%！），\\n说明一旦 exception signal 充足，1.5B 因 LoRA 参数占比更高而更 efficient。\\n这是 \\\"signal-limited not capacity-limited\\\" 论点的最强佐证：pre-transition 区间模型越大越好（noise tolerance），\\npost-transition 区间模型大小几乎无关（signal dominates）。\\n\"\n68\t  },\n69\t  {\n70\t    \"name\": \"tail-384 × DeepSeek-6.7B\",\n71\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B full_trace tail-384 tokens SFT\",\n72\t    \"results\": {\n73\t      \"accuracy\": 0.781,\n74\t      \"accuracy_ci_lower\": 0.757,\n75\t      \"accuracy_ci_upper\": 0.805,\n76\t      \"majority_baseline\": 0.7151,\n77\t      \"lift_over_majority_pp\": 6.6,\n78\t      \"diff_vs_tail256_pp\": 1.7,\n79\t      \"mcnemar_vs_tail256_p\": 0.18,\n80\t      \"diff_vs_tail512_pp\": -15.8\n81\t    },\n82\t    \"tables\": [],\n83\t    \"figures\": [],\n84\t    \"analysis\": \"DeepSeek 384→512 jump = 15.8pp，虽然是 4 模型中最小的（因 DeepSeek tail-512 = 93.9%，post-transition 值最低），\\n但仍远大于 256→384 的 1.7pp（ratio 9.3:1），sharp cliff 结论成立。\\n\\n\\nDeepSeek tail-256 = 76.39%。DeepSeek tokenizer 效率与 Qwen 不同（DeepSeek 使用 32K vocab 的 BPE），\\n同一段 Python trace 在 DeepSeek tokenizer 下可能需要更多 tokens。384 tokens 对应的实际文本覆盖\\n比 Qwen 略少，信息增量更受限。1.7pp 的提升在 bootstrap CI 上与 tail-256 完全重叠。\\ntail-384 不受 VOTA 截断问题影响（独立的固定长度 tail 截断策略），结果 clean。\\nDeepSeek 的 pre-transition plateau（76-78%）与 Qwen-7B（77-80%）接近，\\n说明两个模型在 \\\"猜测能力\\\"（insufficient signal 下的 baseline performance）上几乎一致，\\n真正的差异由 post-transition 的 model-specific factors（LoRA stability、execution reasoning）决定。\\n\"\n85\t  },\n86\t  {\n87\t    \"name\": \"tail-384 × CodeLlama-13B\",\n88\t    \"description\": \"CodeLlama-13B-Instruct full_trace tail-384 tokens SFT\",\n89\t    \"results\": {\n90\t      \"accuracy\": 0.798,\n91\t      \"accuracy_ci_lower\": 0.775,\n92\t      \"accuracy_ci_upper\": 0.821,\n93\t      \"majority_baseline\": 0.7151,\n94\t      \"lift_over_majority_pp\": 8.3,\n95\t      \"diff_vs_tail256_pp\": 1.9,\n96\t      \"mcnemar_vs_tail256_p\": 0.14,\n97\t      \"diff_vs_tail512_pp\": -17.7\n98\t    },\n99\t    \"tables\": [\n100\t      {\n101\t        \"name\": \"4-model tail-384 universal summary\",\n102\t        \"rows\": [\n103\t          {\n104\t            \"model\": \"Qwen-7B\",\n105\t            \"tail256\": \"77.5%\",\n106\t            \"tail384\": \"79.5%\",\n107\t            \"tail512\": \"93.6%\",\n108\t            \"Δ_256_384\": \"+2.0pp\",\n109\t            \"Δ_384_512\": \"+14.1pp\",\n110\t            \"ratio\": \"7.1x\"\n111\t          },\n112\t          {\n113\t            \"model\": \"Qwen-1.5B\",\n114\t            \"tail256\": \"72.6%\",\n115\t            \"tail384\": \"74.8%\",\n116\t            \"tail512\": \"95.6%\",\n117\t            \"Δ_256_384\": \"+2.2pp\",\n118\t            \"Δ_384_512\": \"+20.8pp\",\n119\t            \"ratio\": \"9.5x\"\n120\t          },\n121\t          {\n122\t            \"model\": \"DeepSeek-6.7B\",\n123\t            \"tail256\": \"76.4%\",\n124\t            \"tail384\": \"78.1%\",\n125\t            \"tail512\": \"93.9%\",\n126\t            \"Δ_256_384\": \"+1.7pp\",\n127\t            \"Δ_384_512\": \"+15.8pp\",\n128\t            \"ratio\": \"9.3x\"\n129\t          },\n130\t          {\n131\t            \"model\": \"CodeLlama-13B\",\n132\t            \"tail256\": \"77.9%\",\n133\t            \"tail384\": \"79.8%\",\n134\t            \"tail512\": \"97.5%\",\n135\t            \"Δ_256_384\": \"+1.9pp\",\n136\t            \"Δ_384_512\": \"+17.7pp\",\n137\t            \"ratio\": \"9.3x\"\n138\t          },\n139\t          {\n140\t            \"model\": \"4-model mean\",\n141\t            \"tail256\": \"76.1%\",\n142\t            \"tail384\": \"78.1%\",\n143\t            \"tail512\": \"95.2%\",\n144\t            \"Δ_256_384\": \"+1.95pp\",\n145\t            \"Δ_384_512\": \"+17.10pp\",\n146\t            \"ratio\": \"8.8x\"\n147\t          }\n148\t        ]\n149\t      }\n150\t    ],\n151\t    \"figures\": [],\n152\t    \"analysis\": \"4-model mean tail-384 = 78.1%，在关键指标 [76, 81] 范围内。max diff vs tail-256 = 2.2pp（Qwen-1.5B），在 [0, 3] 内。\\n所有 4 模型 gradient ratio ≥ 7:1，minimum 256→512 jump = 16.1pp（Qwen-7B），在 [15, 23] 内。\\nPhase transition 在 384-512 之间是 universal sharp cliff，构成独立 contribution（Contribution #4）。\\nCliff 的位置与 exception trace 的典型 token 长度吻合（Python exception traceback + error message 通常 150-400 tokens），\\n说明 phase transition 的 physical cause 就是 exception 信号的 inclusion/exclusion threshold。\\n\\n\\nCodeLlama-13B tail-256 = 77.9%。尽管是 4 模型中最大的（13B vs 7B/6.7B/1.5B），\\n其 tail-384 仍受限于相同的 signal availability bottleneck——模型 capacity 无法弥补 data 中 signal 的缺失。\\nCodeLlama 在 tail-512 时达到 97.5%（4 模型最高 post-transition 值），\\n说明更大 capacity 在 signal 充足后的 utilization efficiency 更高。\\n但 384 tokens 下 signal 仍不足，accuracy 停留在 pre-transition plateau。\\n这是 \\\"phase transition is signal-driven, not capacity-driven\\\" 的关键证据：\\n13B 模型在 diagnostic signal 不足时也无法突破 80%。\\n\"\n153\t  },\n154\t  {\n155\t    \"name\": \"cross-seed tail-512 × Qwen-7B\",\n156\t    \"description\": \"Qwen-7B tail-512 × 3 seeds (42/123/456)，验证 post-transition convergence band robustness\",\n157\t    \"results\": {\n158\t      \"seed42_accuracy\": 0.936,\n159\t      \"seed123_accuracy\": 0.929,\n160\t      \"seed456_accuracy\": 0.941,\n161\t      \"mean_accuracy\": 0.935,\n162\t      \"std_pp\": 0.6,\n163\t      \"max_min_range_pp\": 1.2,\n164\t      \"all_seeds_above_tail384_max\": true\n165\t    },\n166\t    \"tables\": [],\n167\t    \"figures\": [],\n168\t    \"analysis\": \"Convergence band [92.9%, 94.1%] 窄且完全位于 post-transition regime。\\n与 exception_only ceiling (99.83%) 的 ~6pp gap 来自 tail-512 truncation 导致的 partial signal loss，\\n而非训练随机性——这 6pp 是 deterministic information gap，不是 stochastic training gap。\\n\\n\\nQwen-7B exception_only 3-seed variance = 0（99.83% 完全一致），说明 signal 充足时该模型对 LoRA 初始化完全不敏感。\\ntail-512 是 post-transition 第一个点（93.6%），signal 已充分但处于 \\\"刚过阈值\\\" 状态——\\n部分样本的 exception 信息在 tail-384→512 窗口的边界上，这些 \\\"边界样本\\\" 的 prediction 对 LoRA 初始化略有敏感。\\n但由于 Qwen 在 exception_only 上展现了极强的训练稳定性，tail-512 的 variance 也应该是 4 模型中最小的。\\nstd ≈ 0.6pp 远低于 2pp 阈值。关键: 即使最差 seed (92.9%) 也远高于 tail-384 最好情况 (~80%)，\\n证明 phase transition 的位置是 seed-robust 的——不存在某个 seed 下 phase transition 右移到 >512 的情况。\\n\"\n169\t  },\n170\t  {\n171\t    \"name\": \"cross-seed tail-512 × Qwen-1.5B\",\n172\t    \"description\": \"Qwen-1.5B tail-512 × 3 seeds\",\n173\t    \"results\": {\n174\t      \"seed42_accuracy\": 0.956,\n175\t      \"seed123_accuracy\": 0.951,\n176\t      \"seed456_accuracy\": 0.958,\n177\t      \"mean_accuracy\": 0.955,\n178\t      \"std_pp\": 0.4\n179\t    },\n180\t    \"tables\": [],\n181\t    \"figures\": [],\n182\t    \"analysis\": \"1.5B tail-512 mean (95.5%) > 7B tail-512 mean (93.5%) 看似反直觉，\\n但与 exception_only 的 \\\"signal-limited not capacity-limited\\\" 完全一致：\\ntail-512 的 signal 已足够简单（接近 exception_only 的 signal quality），\\n1.5B 的参数效率优势在此显现。\\n\\n\\nQwen-1.5B exception_only = 99.83%（与 7B 一致，3 seeds 完美），训练稳定性同样极好。\\ntail-512 single-seed 95.6% 高于 7B 的 93.6%——更小模型在 \\\"near-threshold signal\\\" 条件下\\n可能因 LoRA 参数占总参数比例更高而更 efficient（LoRA rank 相同时，1.5B 的 LoRA 适配能力相对于模型规模更大）。\\n3-seed std ≈ 0.4pp，比 7B 还小，因为 1.5B 的 LoRA landscape 在这个 signal regime 下可能更 smooth。\\n\"\n183\t  },\n184\t  {\n185\t    \"name\": \"cross-seed tail-512 × DeepSeek-6.7B\",\n186\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-6.7B tail-512 × 3 seeds\",\n187\t    \"results\": {\n188\t      \"seed42_accuracy\": 0.939,\n189\t      \"seed123_accuracy\": 0.925,\n190\t      \"seed456_accuracy\": 0.942,\n191\t      \"mean_accuracy\": 0.935,\n192\t      \"std_pp\": 0.9\n193\t    },\n194\t    \"tables\": [],\n195\t    \"figures\": [],\n196\t    \"analysis\": \"DeepSeek tail-512 convergence band [92.5%, 94.2%] 比 exception_only [91.09%, 99.33%] 窄得多。\\nParadox: mixed signal 降低了 ceiling 但也降低了 variance。这暗示极端 seed sensitivity \\n主要是 \\\"pure signal\\\" 条件下的现象——signal 越纯，对 LoRA→signal mapping 的初始化越敏感。\\n\\n\\nDeepSeek exception_only 显示 seed 敏感性（seed123=91.09% 离群，σ≈4.8pp），\\n但 2/3 seeds 鲁棒（99.33%）。tail-512 的 signal 比 exception_only 更 noisy（包含 exception + trace 尾部混合），\\n但 signal 主体仍来自 exception 事件。tail-512 的 \\\"effective signal strength\\\" 处于中间地带——\\n足以学到核心 fault detection pattern 但不足以达 ceiling——\\n这反而限制了 seed-dependent LoRA 初始化差异的影响范围。\\n不会出现 exception_only seed123 那样的极端离群值（91.09%），\\n因为 tail-512 的 mixed signal 降低了模型对单一 mapping (exception→fail) 的依赖。\\nstd ≈ 0.9pp，是 4 模型中最高的，但仍 ≤ 2pp 阈值。\\n\"\n197\t  },\n198\t  {\n199\t    \"name\": \"cross-seed tail-512 × CodeLlama-13B\",\n200\t    \"description\": \"CodeLlama-13B tail-512 × 3 seeds\",\n201\t    \"results\": {\n202\t      \"seed42_accuracy\": 0.975,\n203\t      \"seed123_accuracy\": 0.969,\n204\t      \"seed456_accuracy\": 0.973,\n205\t      \"mean_accuracy\": 0.972,\n206\t      \"std_pp\": 0.3\n207\t    },\n208\t    \"tables\": [\n209\t      {\n210\t        \"name\": \"4-model cross-seed tail-512 summary\",\n211\t        \"rows\": [\n212\t          {\n213\t            \"model\": \"Qwen-7B (7B)\",\n214\t            \"mean\": \"93.5%\",\n215\t            \"std\": \"0.6pp\",\n216\t            \"range\": \"[92.9, 94.1]\",\n217\t            \"n_seeds\": 3\n218\t          },\n219\t          {\n220\t            \"model\": \"Qwen-1.5B (1.5B)\",\n221\t            \"mean\": \"95.5%\",\n222\t            \"std\": \"0.4pp\",\n223\t            \"range\": \"[95.1, 95.8]\",\n224\t            \"n_seeds\": 3\n225\t          },\n226\t          {\n227\t            \"model\": \"DeepSeek (6.7B)\",\n228\t            \"mean\": \"93.5%\",\n229\t            \"std\": \"0.9pp\",\n230\t            \"range\": \"[92.5, 94.2]\",\n231\t            \"n_seeds\": 3\n232\t          },\n233\t          {\n234\t            \"model\": \"CodeLlama (13B)\",\n235\t            \"mean\": \"97.2%\",\n236\t            \"std\": \"0.3pp\",\n237\t            \"range\": \"[96.9, 97.5]\",\n238\t            \"n_seeds\": 3\n239\t          },\n240\t          {\n241\t            \"model\": \"All models\",\n242\t            \"mean\": \"94.9%\",\n243\t            \"max_std\": \"0.9pp\",\n244\t            \"note\": \"all < 2pp threshold\"\n245\t          }\n246\t        ]\n247\t      }\n248\t    ],\n249\t    \"figures\": [],\n250\t    \"analysis\": \"max std = 0.9pp (DeepSeek)，远低于 2pp 阈值。所有模型的 worst seed 都远高于 tail-384 best case (~80%)，\\n确认 phase transition 位置 seed-robust。cross-seed 验证消除了 \\\"single-seed lucky draw\\\" 的审稿人疑虑。\\n结合 plan_016 的 tail-384 数据，可以 claim: phase transition 在 384-512 之间是 universal + sharp + seed-robust。\\n\\n\\nCodeLlama-13B exception_only 3-seed 高度一致（seed42/456=99.83%, seed123=100.0%），\\n训练稳定性极佳——13B 模型的 LoRA landscape 最 smooth。\\ntail-512 single-seed = 97.5%（4 模型最高 post-transition 值），\\n说明 CodeLlama 的 13B capacity 在 signal utilization 上有优势。\\n在如此接近 ceiling 的 accuracy 下，seed variance 极小（≤0.3pp）。\\n几乎所有样本都被正确分类，variance 仅来自极少数边界样本的 stochastic prediction。\\n\"\n251\t  },\n252\t  {\n253\t    \"name\": \"CodeLlama-13B tail-2048 (v3 completion)\",\n254\t    \"description\": \"CodeLlama-13B tail-2048 v3 完成，闭合 4-model budget curve 的最后一个缺失点\",\n255\t    \"results\": {\n256\t      \"accuracy\": 0.965,\n257\t      \"accuracy_ci_lower\": 0.954,\n258\t      \"accuracy_ci_upper\": 0.975,\n259\t      \"pass_f1\": 0.976,\n260\t      \"fail_f1\": 0.938,\n261\t      \"diff_vs_tail1024_pp\": -1.7\n262\t    },\n263\t    \"tables\": [\n264\t      {\n265\t        \"name\": \"4-model complete tail-2048 comparison\",\n266\t        \"rows\": [\n267\t          {\n268\t            \"model\": \"Qwen-7B\",\n269\t            \"tail2048\": \"97.3%\",\n270\t            \"tail1024\": \"96.5%\",\n271\t            \"delta\": \"+0.8pp\"\n272\t          },\n273\t          {\n274\t            \"model\": \"Qwen-1.5B\",\n275\t            \"tail2048\": \"97.9%\",\n276\t            \"tail1024\": \"96.6%\",\n277\t            \"delta\": \"+1.3pp\"\n278\t          },\n279\t          {\n280\t            \"model\": \"DeepSeek-6.7B\",\n281\t            \"tail2048\": \"95.0%\",\n282\t            \"tail1024\": \"96.5%\",\n283\t            \"delta\": \"-1.5pp\"\n284\t          },\n285\t          {\n286\t            \"model\": \"CodeLlama-13B\",\n287\t            \"tail2048\": \"96.5% (pred)\",\n288\t            \"tail1024\": \"98.2%\",\n289\t            \"delta\": \"-1.7pp (pred)\"\n290\t          }\n291\t        ]\n292\t      }\n293\t    ],\n294\t    \"figures\": [],\n295\t    \"analysis\": \"CodeLlama tail-2048 完成后 4 模型 budget curve 矩阵完整（4 models × 6 token budgets）。\\n所有模型的 tail-1024→tail-2048 delta 均 ≤ 2pp（正或负），confirming ceiling plateau。\\nDeepSeek 和 CodeLlama 在 tail-2048 略低于 tail-1024 可能反映 attention dilution at longer sequences。\\n\\n\\nCodeLlama tail-1024 v3 = 98.24%（epoch1 best）。tail-2048 与 tail-1024 的信息增量极小\\n（1024-2048 区间主要是 loop iterations 和 variable dumps，与 diagnostic signal 无关）。\\nv2 曾 catastrophic failure（29.6%）因 full-sequence loss dilution + CodeLlama tokenizer 在 2048 tokens 时\\n生成大量 non-diagnostic tokens，loss 被稀释到 label token 无法获得足够梯度。\\nv3 采用 label-preserving truncation fix 应避免 catastrophic failure。\\n但 2048 tokens 的 attention dilution 可能导致 accuracy 略低于 tail-1024（98.24%→96.5%），\\n类似 Qwen-7B tail-1024 (96.47%) → tail-2048 (97.3%) 的 pattern，但 CodeLlama 因 tokenizer 效率差异可能退化。\\n其他模型 tail-2048 参照: Qwen-7B 97.3%, Qwen-1.5B 97.9%, DeepSeek 94.96%。\\nCodeLlama 96.5% 处于合理范围，在 [95, 98] 关键指标内。\\n\"\n296\t  },\n297\t  {\n298\t    \"name\": \"Failure mode analysis (no GPU)\",\n299\t    \"description\": \"用已有 predictions.jsonl 系统分析 exception_only/VOTA/full_trace/no_trace 的 failure modes\",\n300\t    \"results\": {\n301\t      \"exception_only_errors\": {\n302\t        \"total\": 2,\n303\t        \"generator_exit_false_positive\": 2,\n304\t        \"error_concentration\": \"100% from HumanEval/95 check_dict_case\",\n305\t        \"interpretability\": \"fully deterministic, representation-inherent\"\n306\t      },\n307\t      \"vota_errors\": {\n308\t        \"total\": 7,\n309\t        \"exception_overlap_with_exc_only\": 2,\n310\t        \"loop_noise_confusion\": 3,\n311\t        \"ae_edge_case\": 2,\n312\t        \"interpretability\": \"partially interpretable\"\n313\t      },\n314\t      \"full_trace_errors\": {\n315\t        \"total\": 217,\n316\t        \"fail_recall_dominated\": true,\n317\t        \"scattered_distribution\": true,\n318\t        \"top_error_category\": \"information overload — no dominant pattern\",\n319\t        \"interpretability\": \"low — diffuse across problem types\"\n320\t      },\n321\t      \"no_trace_errors\": {\n322\t        \"total\": 296,\n323\t        \"majority_class_bias\": true,\n324\t        \"fail_recall\": 0.7345,\n325\t        \"systematic_pattern\": \"under-predicts fail (minority class)\",\n326\t        \"interpretability\": \"high — systematic bias, single root cause\"\n327\t      },\n328\t      \"tier1_vs_tier2_failure_modes_qualitatively_distinct\": true,\n329\t      \"error_overlap_hierarchy\": \"exc_only(2) ⊂ vota(7) ⊂ full_trace(217)\"\n330\t    },\n331\t    \"tables\": [\n332\t      {\n333\t        \"name\": \"Error mode summary by condition\",\n334\t        \"rows\": [\n335\t          {\n336\t            \"condition\": \"exception_only\",\n337\t            \"n_errors\": 2,\n338\t            \"dominant_mode\": \"GeneratorExit false positive\",\n339\t            \"interpretable\": \"100%\",\n340\t            \"actionable\": \"tracer fix\"\n341\t          },\n342\t          {\n343\t            \"condition\": \"VOTA\",\n344\t            \"n_errors\": 7,\n345\t            \"dominant_mode\": \"loop noise + edge assertion\",\n346\t            \"interpretable\": \"~60%\",\n347\t            \"actionable\": \"component pruning\"\n348\t          },\n349\t          {\n350\t            \"condition\": \"full_trace\",\n351\t            \"n_errors\": \"~217\",\n352\t            \"dominant_mode\": \"scattered / information overload\",\n353\t            \"interpretable\": \"<20%\",\n354\t            \"actionable\": \"unclear\"\n355\t          },\n356\t          {\n357\t            \"condition\": \"no_trace\",\n358\t            \"n_errors\": \"~296\",\n359\t            \"dominant_mode\": \"majority-class bias\",\n360\t            \"interpretable\": \"100%\",\n361\t            \"actionable\": \"add any signal\"\n362\t          }\n363\t        ]\n364\t      }\n365\t    ],\n366\t    \"figures\": [],\n367\t    \"analysis\": \"Error analysis 为 two-tier hierarchy 增加第三个 evidence dimension（accuracy / calibration / error interpretability）。\\nTier 1 的 failure mode 是 deterministic + representation-inherent（可通过 tracer 改进消除），\\nlower-tier 的 failure mode 是 stochastic + capability-dependent（改进路径不明确）。\\n这强化 design principle: 最高 specificity 的 signal 不仅 accuracy 最高、calibration 最好，\\n其 failure mode 也最可解释和最可修复。\\n\\n\\nexception_only 的 2 个错误已被彻底分析（GeneratorExit, id=901/905），error analysis 将确认无新发现。\\nVOTA 在 exception_only 基础上增加了 loop + ae 信号，VOTA 的 7 个错误中 2 个与 exception_only 重叠（GeneratorExit），\\n剩余 5 个是 loop compression 引入的噪声：部分样本的 loop 行为 \\\"看似正常\\\" 但实际有 subtle fault，\\n或者正常 loop 信息稀释了 exception signal 的 attention weight。\\nfull_trace 的 ~217 个错误（81.76% accuracy, 1190 × (1-0.8176) ≈ 217）呈散射分布——\\ninformation overload 使模型无法对任何 single signal source 形成 stable attention pattern，\\n错误跨越多种程序类型和错误类型，无清晰聚类。fail_recall 尤其差（69.6%），因为 fail 样本的 diagnostic signal \\n被 irrelevant trace tokens 淹没。\\nno_trace 的 ~296 个错误主要来自 fail class under-prediction（majority class bias）。\\n关键发现: error interpretability 与 tier level 正相关——Tier 1 error 100% interpretable，\\nTier 2/full_trace error 呈 stochastic noise pattern。\\n\"\n368\t  },\n369\t  {\n370\t    \"name\": \"Cross-model calibration (4 models × exception_only)\",\n371\t    \"description\": \"4 models exception_only 的 ECE/Brier Score 对比，验证 calibration quality 跨模型 universal\",\n372\t    \"results\": {\n373\t      \"qwen7b\": {\n374\t        \"ece\": 0.0027,\n375\t        \"brier\": 0.0013,\n376\t        \"accuracy\": 0.9983,\n377\t        \"note\": \"existing data\"\n378\t      },\n379\t      \"qwen15b\": {\n380\t        \"ece\": 0.0031,\n381\t        \"brier\": 0.0015,\n382\t        \"accuracy\": 0.9983\n383\t      },\n384\t      \"deepseek\": {\n385\t        \"ece\": 0.0082,\n386\t        \"brier\": 0.0055,\n387\t        \"accuracy\": 0.9933\n388\t      },\n389\t      \"codellama13b\": {\n390\t        \"ece\": 0.0024,\n391\t        \"brier\": 0.0011,\n392\t        \"accuracy\": 0.9983\n393\t      },\n394\t      \"max_ece\": 0.0082,\n395\t      \"min_ece_ratio_vs_notrace\": \"21x (DeepSeek)\",\n396\t      \"max_ece_ratio_vs_notrace\": \"71x (CodeLlama)\",\n397\t      \"calibration_universally_excellent\": true\n398\t    },\n399\t    \"tables\": [\n400\t      {\n401\t        \"name\": \"4-model exception_only calibration comparison\",\n402\t        \"rows\": [\n403\t          {\n404\t            \"model\": \"Qwen-7B\",\n405\t            \"accuracy\": \"99.83%\",\n406\t            \"ece\": 0.0027,\n407\t            \"brier\": 0.0013,\n408\t            \"ece/notrace_ece\": \"63x\"\n409\t          },\n410\t          {\n411\t            \"model\": \"Qwen-1.5B\",\n412\t            \"accuracy\": \"99.83%\",\n413\t            \"ece\": 0.0031,\n414\t            \"brier\": 0.0015,\n415\t            \"ece/notrace_ece\": \"55x\"\n416\t          },\n417\t          {\n418\t            \"model\": \"DeepSeek-6.7B\",\n419\t            \"accuracy\": \"99.33%\",\n420\t            \"ece\": 0.0082,\n421\t            \"brier\": 0.0055,\n422\t            \"ece/notrace_ece\": \"21x\"\n423\t          },\n424\t          {\n425\t            \"model\": \"CodeLlama-13B\",\n426\t            \"accuracy\": \"99.83%\",\n427\t            \"ece\": 0.0024,\n428\t            \"brier\": 0.0011,\n429\t            \"ece/notrace_ece\": \"71x\"\n430\t          }\n431\t        ]\n432\t      }\n433\t    ],\n434\t    \"figures\": [],\n435\t    \"analysis\": \"4-model calibration universality 是论文的 supplementary evidence。与 accuracy universality 互补：\\nexception signal 不仅让所有模型 \\\"预测对\\\"，更让所有模型 \\\"知道自己对\\\"。\\nDeepSeek ECE 略高 (0.008 vs 0.002-0.003) 反映其 LoRA seed sensitivity 的残余效应，\\n但在 practical 意义上仍属 \\\"近完美校准\\\"。\\n\\n\\nQwen-7B 已有数据（ECE=0.0027, Brier=0.0013），作为参照。\\nQwen-1.5B 与 7B 的 exception_only 结果完全一致（99.83%, 相同 2 个 irreducible errors），\\n其 softmax 分布应高度相似。1.5B 模型的 logit scale 可能略大（更少参数→更少 regularization→logits 更尖锐），\\n但由于 accuracy 完全一致，ECE 应同样极低。预测 ECE≈0.003, Brier≈0.0015。\\nCodeLlama-13B exception_only 同为 99.83%（seed42/456）且 seed123=100%，\\n更大模型通常 logit 更 smooth → calibration 可能更好。预测 ECE≈0.0024, Brier≈0.0011。\\nDeepSeek exception_only = 99.33%（seed42），8/1190 errors 比 Qwen 多 6 个，\\n这些额外错误样本的 confidence 分布可能不那么极端（错误样本可能 confidence 居中而非极高），\\n导致 ECE 略高（~0.008）。但仍远低于 no_trace baseline（0.171），ratio ≈ 21x。\\n关键: 所有 4 模型 ECE < 0.01，跨 3 families/2 scales calibration 一致优秀，\\n确认 Tier 1 signal 的 calibration benefit 是 model-agnostic 的。\\n\"\n436\t  },\n437\t  {\n438\t    \"name\": \"Few-shot prompting baseline (GPT-4o / Claude)\",\n439\t    \"description\": \"GPT-4o 和 Claude 在 exception_only traces 上的 0-shot + 3-shot verdict prediction，作为 non-SFT upper bound\",\n440\t    \"results\": {\n441\t      \"gpt4o_0shot\": {\n442\t        \"accuracy\": 0.932,\n443\t        \"fail_recall\": 0.83,\n444\t        \"pass_recall\": 0.97\n445\t      },\n446\t      \"gpt4o_3shot\": {\n447\t        \"accuracy\": 0.951,\n448\t        \"fail_recall\": 0.88,\n449\t        \"pass_recall\": 0.98\n450\t      },\n451\t      \"claude_0shot\": {\n452\t        \"accuracy\": 0.942,\n453\t        \"fail_recall\": 0.86,\n454\t        \"pass_recall\": 0.98\n455\t      },\n456\t      \"claude_3shot\": {\n457\t        \"accuracy\": 0.961,\n458\t        \"fail_recall\": 0.91,\n459\t        \"pass_recall\": 0.98\n460\t      },\n461\t      \"sft_exception_only_best\": 0.9983,\n462\t      \"sft_advantage_over_best_fewshot_pp\": 3.7,\n463\t      \"sft_error_rate_ratio\": \"11.5x fewer errors\"\n464\t    },\n465\t    \"tables\": [\n466\t      {\n467\t        \"name\": \"SFT vs Few-shot vs Zero-shot comparison\",\n468\t        \"rows\": [\n469\t          {\n470\t            \"method\": \"SFT exception_only (Qwen-7B, 3 seeds mean)\",\n471\t            \"accuracy\": \"99.83%\",\n472\t            \"errors\": 2,\n473\t            \"type\": \"parameter adaptation\"\n474\t          },\n475\t          {\n476\t            \"method\": \"SFT exception_only (Qwen-1.5B)\",\n477\t            \"accuracy\": \"99.83%\",\n478\t            \"errors\": 2,\n479\t            \"type\": \"parameter adaptation\"\n480\t          },\n481\t          {\n482\t            \"method\": \"Claude 3-shot\",\n483\t            \"accuracy\": \"~96.1%\",\n484\t            \"errors\": \"~46\",\n485\t            \"type\": \"in-context learning\"\n486\t          },\n487\t          {\n488\t            \"method\": \"GPT-4o 3-shot\",\n489\t            \"accuracy\": \"~95.1%\",\n490\t            \"errors\": \"~58\",\n491\t            \"type\": \"in-context learning\"\n492\t          },\n493\t          {\n494\t            \"method\": \"Claude 0-shot\",\n495\t            \"accuracy\": \"~94.2%\",\n496\t            \"errors\": \"~69\",\n497\t            \"type\": \"instruction following\"\n498\t          },\n499\t          {\n500\t            \"method\": \"GPT-4o 0-shot\",\n501\t            \"accuracy\": \"~93.2%\",\n502\t            \"errors\": \"~81\",\n503\t            \"type\": \"instruction following\"\n504\t          },\n505\t          {\n506\t            \"method\": \"Qwen-1.5B 0-shot (base)\",\n507\t            \"accuracy\": \"93.45%\",\n508\t            \"errors\": 78,\n509\t            \"type\": \"base model\"\n510\t          },\n511\t          {\n512\t            \"method\": \"Qwen-7B few-shot (base)\",\n513\t            \"accuracy\": \"90.84%\",\n514\t            \"errors\": 109,\n515\t            \"type\": \"base model\"\n516\t          },\n517\t          {\n518\t            \"method\": \"Qwen-7B 0-shot (base)\",\n519\t            \"accuracy\": \"89.08%\",\n520\t            \"errors\": 130,\n521\t            \"type\": \"base model\"\n522\t          }\n523\t        ]\n524\t      }\n525\t    ],\n526\t    \"figures\": [],\n527\t    \"analysis\": \"Few-shot baseline 回答两个潜在审稿人问题:\\n(1) \\\"为什么需要 SFT? Frontier model 不能直接做?\\\" → No, 即使 GPT-4o/Claude 3-shot 也比 SFT 7B 差 3.7pp (11.5x more errors)。\\n(2) \\\"SFT 的 value 是什么?\\\" → parameter-level adaptation 将 error rate 从 ~4% 压到 representation-inherent floor 0.17%。\\n更深层: SFT exception_only (1.5B, ~$0.5 GPU-hr) > Claude 3-shot (~$50 API)，\\n说明 \\\"right signal + cheap SFT\\\" 优于 \\\"frontier model + expensive inference\\\"，\\n这是论文 practical impact 的核心论点。\\n\\n\\n已有 base model zero-shot 数据: Qwen-7B 89.08%, DeepSeek-7B 90.59%, Qwen-1.5B 93.45%, CodeLlama-13B 51.01%。\\nFrontier 模型（GPT-4o, Claude）有更强的 instruction following、更大 context window、更好的 reasoning，\\nzero-shot 应 > 所有 base model zero-shot。GPT-4o zero-shot 预测 ~93%（类似 Qwen-1.5B zero-shot 93.45%，\\n但 GPT-4o 对 structured error data 的理解更好）。Claude 可能略高（~94%）因其 instruction following 更精准。\\n3-shot 提供 exemplars 帮助模型理解 output format 和 decision boundary，预计提升 2-3pp：\\nGPT-4o 3-shot ~95%, Claude 3-shot ~96%。\\n然而 few-shot 受限于 in-context learning 的 fundamental limitation: (1) 仅 3 个 examples 无法覆盖所有 edge cases，\\n(2) attention 需同时处理 instructions + examples + query，(3) 无 parameter-level adaptation。\\nSFT exception_only (99.83%) 仍 > best few-shot (~96%) 约 3.7pp。\\n虽然 3.7pp 看似小，但在 error rate 上是 11.5x 差异（0.17% vs 3.9%）——\\nSFT 达到 representation 理论上限，few-shot 仍有 ~39 个额外错误。\\n关键: fail_recall 差距更大（SFT 100% vs few-shot ~91%），说明 few-shot 在 minority class 上更差。\\n\"\n528\t  },\n529\t  {\n530\t    \"name\": \"OOD generalization (cross-language traces)\",\n531\t    \"description\": \"在 Python 外的编程语言 (Java/JavaScript) trace 上测试 exception_only 泛化性\",\n532\t    \"results\": {\n533\t      \"java_exception_only_accuracy\": 0.972,\n534\t      \"javascript_exception_only_accuracy\": 0.963,\n535\t      \"python_in_domain_accuracy\": 0.9983,\n536\t      \"ood_mean_accuracy\": 0.968,\n537\t      \"ood_gap_vs_in_domain_pp\": 3.1,\n538\t      \"ood_vs_python_no_trace_pp\": \"+21.6\"\n539\t    },\n540\t    \"tables\": [\n541\t      {\n542\t        \"name\": \"Cross-language exception_only accuracy\",\n543\t        \"rows\": [\n544\t          {\n545\t            \"language\": \"Python (in-domain)\",\n546\t            \"accuracy\": \"99.83%\",\n547\t            \"n\": 1190,\n548\t            \"note\": \"training language\"\n549\t          },\n550\t          {\n551\t            \"language\": \"Java (OOD)\",\n552\t            \"accuracy\": \"~97.2%\",\n553\t            \"n\": \"~500\",\n554\t            \"note\": \"NullPointerException 等 novel types\"\n555\t          },\n556\t          {\n557\t            \"language\": \"JavaScript (OOD)\",\n558\t            \"accuracy\": \"~96.3%\",\n559\t            \"n\": \"~500\",\n560\t            \"note\": \"TypeError/ReferenceError novel\"\n561\t          }\n562\t        ]\n563\t      }\n564\t    ],\n565\t    \"figures\": [],\n566\t    \"analysis\": \"OOD 是 \\\"nice-to-have\\\" 而非 \\\"must-have\\\"。4 models × 3 families × 2 scales 的 in-domain universality\\n已构成充分证据。OOD 数据若好（>96%）则是 reviewer concern 的 decisive counter-argument，\\n但构建成本高。建议: 如果 plan_016/017 结果确认 best tier，OOD 可留为 camera-ready supplement；\\n如果 plan_016/017 结果弱于预期，OOD 的必要性上升。\\n\\n\\nexception_only 学到的核心 pattern 是 \\\"[ERROR] 标记存在 → fault detected → predict fail\\\" 的映射。\\n这个 pattern 的语言依赖性极低: Java (try/catch → Exception class + message)、\\nJavaScript (try/catch → Error type + message) 的 exception 结构与 Python 高度同构。\\ntracer 生成的 [ERROR] tag 格式跨语言一致（由 tracer 标准化），因此 SFT 模型学到的 pattern 可迁移。\\naccuracy 从 99.83% 降到 ~97% 的 gap 来源: (1) OOD exception message 的 lexical distribution 与 Python 不同\\n（Java 的 NullPointerException、JavaScript 的 TypeError 在训练集中缺失），\\n(2) 少数语言特有 edge case（如 Java checked exception 是正常控制流，非 fault indicator）。\\n关键: 如果 OOD > 96%，说明 exception signal 的 fault detection 语义跨语言 universal，\\nSFT 学到的不是 Python-specific pattern 而是 general fault indicator recognition。\\n风险: 构建高质量 OOD 测试集需要 non-trivial 工程（不同语言的 tracer + benchmark），\\n如果时间不足应优先确保 plan_016/017 的 core experiments。\\n\"\n567\t  },\n568\t  {\n569\t    \"name\": \"Training dynamics (step-level learning curve)\",\n570\t    \"description\": \"exception_only vs full_trace 的 step-level eval learning curve，量化 convergence speed 差异\",\n571\t    \"results\": {\n572\t      \"exception_only\": {\n573\t        \"steps_to_90pct\": 60,\n574\t        \"steps_to_95pct\": 80,\n575\t        \"steps_to_99pct\": 150,\n576\t        \"steps_to_final\": 200,\n577\t        \"final_accuracy\": 0.9983,\n578\t        \"loss_at_step50\": 0.15\n579\t      },\n580\t      \"full_trace\": {\n581\t        \"steps_to_80pct\": 250,\n582\t        \"steps_to_final\": \"900 (3 epochs)\",\n583\t        \"final_accuracy\": 0.8176,\n584\t        \"never_reaches_90\": true,\n585\t        \"loss_at_step50\": 0.35\n586\t      },\n587\t      \"convergence_speed_ratio\": \"4.2x (steps to reach full_trace ceiling)\",\n588\t      \"crossover_step\": 45\n589\t    },\n590\t    \"tables\": [\n591\t      {\n592\t        \"name\": \"Convergence milestone comparison\",\n593\t        \"rows\": [\n594\t          {\n595\t            \"milestone\": \"80% accuracy\",\n596\t            \"exception_only\": \"~30 steps (~4 min)\",\n597\t            \"full_trace\": \"~250 steps (~35 min)\"\n598\t          },\n599\t          {\n600\t            \"milestone\": \"90% accuracy\",\n601\t            \"exception_only\": \"~60 steps (~8 min)\",\n602\t            \"full_trace\": \"never reached\"\n603\t          },\n604\t          {\n605\t            \"milestone\": \"95% accuracy\",\n606\t            \"exception_only\": \"~80 steps (~11 min)\",\n607\t            \"full_trace\": \"never reached\"\n608\t          },\n609\t          {\n610\t            \"milestone\": \"99% accuracy\",\n611\t            \"exception_only\": \"~150 steps (~21 min)\",\n612\t            \"full_trace\": \"never reached\"\n613\t          },\n614\t          {\n615\t            \"milestone\": \"final\",\n616\t            \"exception_only\": \"99.83% @ ~200 steps\",\n617\t            \"full_trace\": \"81.76% @ ~900 steps\"\n618\t          }\n619\t        ]\n620\t      }\n621\t    ],\n622\t    \"figures\": [],\n623\t    \"analysis\": \"Training dynamics 提供 information density 假说的 dynamic evidence，与 label_only ablation 的 static evidence 互补:\\n- Static evidence (plan_002): gradient dilution 贡献 26%，information overload 贡献 74%\\n- Dynamic evidence (plan_022): exception_only converge 4.2x faster + reaches higher ceiling\\n两者共同证明: 高信息密度信号不仅提升 accuracy ceiling，更 dramatically 加速 learning。\\nCrossover at ~45 steps 是论文中最直观的 \\\"why exception works\\\" evidence —— \\n\\\"一个极简信号在 50 步内超越完整 trace 训练 3 个 epoch 的结果\\\"。\\n\\nexception_only 的有效训练信号高度集中: pass 样本对应 \\\"无 [ERROR]\\\"，fail 样本对应 \\\"有 [ERROR] + type + message\\\"。\\n这是一个 near-binary feature，模型只需学习 \\\"[ERROR] presence → fail\\\" 的 mapping，\\n所需训练步数极少。训练集 effective unique 样本仅 2858 条，batch_size=4 时 ~715 steps/epoch。\\n50-100 steps（约 7-14% epoch）内模型应已捕获核心 pattern，accuracy > 95%。\\nfull_trace 包含大量 irrelevant tokens（variable values, memory addresses, loop iterations），\\n模型需要 (1) 先学到忽略 irrelevant tokens 的 attention pattern，\\n(2) 再从 relevant tokens 中 extract fault signal。这是两阶段 learning，天然更慢。\\n且 information overload 导致 attention 无法稳定聚焦，收敛到 ~82% 后 plateau（受 noise ceiling 限制）。\\ncrossover 预测在 ~45 steps: exception_only 在不到 50 steps 时就超过 full_trace 的最终 accuracy (81.76%)。\\n这意味着 SFT exception_only 10 分钟的训练 > SFT full_trace 3 个 epoch 的训练，\\n是论文中极具冲击力的 figure。\\n\"\n624\t  }\n625\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01f816b3-f92f-4f34-a12d-93882a8a178e","uuid":"401f2d37-5334-4705-86e8-695d0dcecc3e","timestamp":"2026-05-18T12:08:07.856Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_4/projects/trace-verdict-study/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T113804/best/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"tail-384 × Qwen-7B\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen-2.5-Coder-7B full_trace tail-384 tokens SFT，精确定位 256→512 phase transition 左边界\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"accuracy\": 0.795,\n      \"accuracy_ci_lower\": 0.772,\n      \"accuracy_ci_upper\": 0.818,\n      \"majority_baseline\": 0.7151,\n      \"lift_over_majority_pp\": 8.0,\n      \"pass_f1\": 0.849,\n      \"fail_f1\": 0.682,\n      \"diff_vs_tail256_pp\": 2.0,\n      \"mcnemar_vs_tail256_p\": 0.15,\n      \"diff_vs_tail512_pp\": -14.1\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Qwen-7B tail budget curve (complete)\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"tokens\": 256,\n            \"accuracy\": \"77.5%\",\n            \"regime\": \"pre-transition plateau\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"tokens\": 384,\n            \"accuracy\": \"79.5% (pred)\",\n            \"regime\": \"pre-transition plateau\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"tokens\": 512,\n            \"accuracy\": \"93.6%\",\n            \"regime\": \"post-transition rise\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"tokens\": 1024,\n            \"accuracy\": \"96.5%\",\n            \"regime\": \"ceiling plateau\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"tokens\": 2048,\n            \"accuracy\": \"97.3%\",\n            \"regime\": \"ceiling plateau\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"256→384 Δ=2.0pp vs 384→512 Δ=14.1pp，gradient ratio ~7:1。\\n384 是 \\\"sharp cliff 的左脚\\\"——phase transition 的数学定义要求存在一个 token budget t*\\n使得 accuracy(t*-ε) ≈ accuracy(t*-2ε) 但 accuracy(t*+ε) >> accuracy(t*)。\\n384 的数据精确刻画了这个 t* ≈ 400-450 的位置。\\n\\n\\nQwen-7B tail-256 = 77.48%。384 tokens 仅多 128 tokens（约 6-8 行代码）。trace 末尾的 diagnostic 信号分布呈高度右偏：\\nexception trace 的核心内容（[ERROR] type + message + traceback 最后几帧）集中在 trace 的最后 400-500 tokens。\\n在 384 token 窗口下，仅有少数 \\\"短 exception\\\"（如单行 AssertionError）的样本能被完整捕获，\\n大多数样本的 exception 信息仍被截断或完全缺失。因此 accuracy 仅小幅提升 ~2pp。\\nMcNemar p>0.1 说明提升在统计上不显著——384 和 256 处于同一个 \\\"insufficient signal\\\" regime。\\n这与 information density 假说一致：trace 末尾的 marginal information 在 384 之前主要是 loop 尾部和 assertion 结构的碎片，\\n尚未到达 exception 信号的密集区，因此 accuracy 曲线保持 flat。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"tail-384 × Qwen-1.5B\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen-2.5-Coder-1.5B full_trace tail-384 tokens SFT\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"accuracy\": 0.748,\n      \"accuracy_ci_lower\": 0.722,\n      \"accuracy_ci_upper\": 0.773,\n      \"majority_baseline\": 0.7151,\n      \"lift_over_majority_pp\": 3.3,\n      \"diff_vs_tail256_pp\": 2.2,\n      \"mcnemar_vs_tail256_p\": 0.12,\n      \"diff_vs_tail512_pp\": -20.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"1.5B 的 pre-transition→post-transition jump 是 4 模型中最大的（72.6%→95.6% = 23.0pp），\\n因为它在 pre-transition 区间最差（最小模型最不耐 noise），但在 post-transition 区间并不落后。\\n这放大了 phase transition 的 visual contrast，使 S-curve 最为陡峭。\\n\\n\\nQwen-1.5B tail-256 = 72.6%，甚至低于 majority baseline（71.5%），lift CI 跨 0。\\n更小模型在 insufficient signal 条件下表现更差——1.5B 的 attention capacity 有限，\\n在信号被 noise 淹没时无法有效 extract 任何 useful pattern。384 tokens 同样 signal-insufficient，\\naccuracy 仅提升到 ~74.8%。然而 1.5B 在 tail-512 时跳到 95.6%（高于 7B 的 93.6%！），\\n说明一旦 exception signal 充足，1.5B 因 LoRA 参数占比更高而更 efficient。\\n这是 \\\"signal-limited not capacity-limited\\\" 论点的最强佐证：pre-transition 区间模型越大越好（noise tolerance），\\npost-transition 区间模型大小几乎无关（signal dominates）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"tail-384 × DeepSeek-6.7B\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B full_trace tail-384 tokens SFT\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"accuracy\": 0.781,\n      \"accuracy_ci_lower\": 0.757,\n      \"accuracy_ci_upper\": 0.805,\n      \"majority_baseline\": 0.7151,\n      \"lift_over_majority_pp\": 6.6,\n      \"diff_vs_tail256_pp\": 1.7,\n      \"mcnemar_vs_tail256_p\": 0.18,\n      \"diff_vs_tail512_pp\": -15.8\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"DeepSeek 384→512 jump = 15.8pp，虽然是 4 模型中最小的（因 DeepSeek tail-512 = 93.9%，post-transition 值最低），\\n但仍远大于 256→384 的 1.7pp（ratio 9.3:1），sharp cliff 结论成立。\\n\\n\\nDeepSeek tail-256 = 76.39%。DeepSeek tokenizer 效率与 Qwen 不同（DeepSeek 使用 32K vocab 的 BPE），\\n同一段 Python trace 在 DeepSeek tokenizer 下可能需要更多 tokens。384 tokens 对应的实际文本覆盖\\n比 Qwen 略少，信息增量更受限。1.7pp 的提升在 bootstrap CI 上与 tail-256 完全重叠。\\ntail-384 不受 VOTA 截断问题影响（独立的固定长度 tail 截断策略），结果 clean。\\nDeepSeek 的 pre-transition plateau（76-78%）与 Qwen-7B（77-80%）接近，\\n说明两个模型在 \\\"猜测能力\\\"（insufficient signal 下的 baseline performance）上几乎一致，\\n真正的差异由 post-transition 的 model-specific factors（LoRA stability、execution reasoning）决定。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"tail-384 × CodeLlama-13B\",\n    \"description\": \"CodeLlama-13B-Instruct full_trace tail-384 tokens SFT\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"accuracy\": 0.798,\n      \"accuracy_ci_lower\": 0.775,\n      \"accuracy_ci_upper\": 0.821,\n      \"majority_baseline\": 0.7151,\n      \"lift_over_majority_pp\": 8.3,\n      \"diff_vs_tail256_pp\": 1.9,\n      \"mcnemar_vs_tail256_p\": 0.14,\n      \"diff_vs_tail512_pp\": -17.7\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"4-model tail-384 universal summary\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"model\": \"Qwen-7B\",\n            \"tail256\": \"77.5%\",\n            \"tail384\": \"79.5%\",\n            \"tail512\": \"93.6%\",\n            \"Δ_256_384\": \"+2.0pp\",\n            \"Δ_384_512\": \"+14.1pp\",\n            \"ratio\": \"7.1x\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"model\": \"Qwen-1.5B\",\n            \"tail256\": \"72.6%\",\n            \"tail384\": \"74.8%\",\n            \"tail512\": \"95.6%\",\n            \"Δ_256_384\": \"+2.2pp\",\n            \"Δ_384_512\": \"+20.8pp\",\n            \"ratio\": \"9.5x\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"model\": \"DeepSeek-6.7B\",\n            \"tail256\": \"76.4%\",\n            \"tail384\": \"78.1%\",\n            \"tail512\": \"93.9%\",\n            \"Δ_256_384\": \"+1.7pp\",\n            \"Δ_384_512\": \"+15.8pp\",\n            \"ratio\": \"9.3x\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"model\": \"CodeLlama-13B\",\n            \"tail256\": \"77.9%\",\n            \"tail384\": \"79.8%\",\n            \"tail512\": \"97.5%\",\n            \"Δ_256_384\": \"+1.9pp\",\n            \"Δ_384_512\": \"+17.7pp\",\n            \"ratio\": \"9.3x\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"model\": \"4-model mean\",\n            \"tail256\": \"76.1%\",\n            \"tail384\": \"78.1%\",\n            \"tail512\": \"95.2%\",\n            \"Δ_256_384\": \"+1.95pp\",\n            \"Δ_384_512\": \"+17.10pp\",\n            \"ratio\": \"8.8x\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"4-model mean tail-384 = 78.1%，在关键指标 [76, 81] 范围内。max diff vs tail-256 = 2.2pp（Qwen-1.5B），在 [0, 3] 内。\\n所有 4 模型 gradient ratio ≥ 7:1，minimum 256→512 jump = 16.1pp（Qwen-7B），在 [15, 23] 内。\\nPhase transition 在 384-512 之间是 universal sharp cliff，构成独立 contribution（Contribution #4）。\\nCliff 的位置与 exception trace 的典型 token 长度吻合（Python exception traceback + error message 通常 150-400 tokens），\\n说明 phase transition 的 physical cause 就是 exception 信号的 inclusion/exclusion threshold。\\n\\n\\nCodeLlama-13B tail-256 = 77.9%。尽管是 4 模型中最大的（13B vs 7B/6.7B/1.5B），\\n其 tail-384 仍受限于相同的 signal availability bottleneck——模型 capacity 无法弥补 data 中 signal 的缺失。\\nCodeLlama 在 tail-512 时达到 97.5%（4 模型最高 post-transition 值），\\n说明更大 capacity 在 signal 充足后的 utilization efficiency 更高。\\n但 384 tokens 下 signal 仍不足，accuracy 停留在 pre-transition plateau。\\n这是 \\\"phase transition is signal-driven, not capacity-driven\\\" 的关键证据：\\n13B 模型在 diagnostic signal 不足时也无法突破 80%。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"cross-seed tail-512 × Qwen-7B\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen-7B tail-512 × 3 seeds (42/123/456)，验证 post-transition convergence band robustness\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed42_accuracy\": 0.936,\n      \"seed123_accuracy\": 0.929,\n      \"seed456_accuracy\": 0.941,\n      \"mean_accuracy\": 0.935,\n      \"std_pp\": 0.6,\n      \"max_min_range_pp\": 1.2,\n      \"all_seeds_above_tail384_max\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Convergence band [92.9%, 94.1%] 窄且完全位于 post-transition regime。\\n与 exception_only ceiling (99.83%) 的 ~6pp gap 来自 tail-512 truncation 导致的 partial signal loss，\\n而非训练随机性——这 6pp 是 deterministic information gap，不是 stochastic training gap。\\n\\n\\nQwen-7B exception_only 3-seed variance = 0（99.83% 完全一致），说明 signal 充足时该模型对 LoRA 初始化完全不敏感。\\ntail-512 是 post-transition 第一个点（93.6%），signal 已充分但处于 \\\"刚过阈值\\\" 状态——\\n部分样本的 exception 信息在 tail-384→512 窗口的边界上，这些 \\\"边界样本\\\" 的 prediction 对 LoRA 初始化略有敏感。\\n但由于 Qwen 在 exception_only 上展现了极强的训练稳定性，tail-512 的 variance 也应该是 4 模型中最小的。\\nstd ≈ 0.6pp 远低于 2pp 阈值。关键: 即使最差 seed (92.9%) 也远高于 tail-384 最好情况 (~80%)，\\n证明 phase transition 的位置是 seed-robust 的——不存在某个 seed 下 phase transition 右移到 >512 的情况。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"cross-seed tail-512 × Qwen-1.5B\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen-1.5B tail-512 × 3 seeds\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed42_accuracy\": 0.956,\n      \"seed123_accuracy\": 0.951,\n      \"seed456_accuracy\": 0.958,\n      \"mean_accuracy\": 0.955,\n      \"std_pp\": 0.4\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"1.5B tail-512 mean (95.5%) > 7B tail-512 mean (93.5%) 看似反直觉，\\n但与 exception_only 的 \\\"signal-limited not capacity-limited\\\" 完全一致：\\ntail-512 的 signal 已足够简单（接近 exception_only 的 signal quality），\\n1.5B 的参数效率优势在此显现。\\n\\n\\nQwen-1.5B exception_only = 99.83%（与 7B 一致，3 seeds 完美），训练稳定性同样极好。\\ntail-512 single-seed 95.6% 高于 7B 的 93.6%——更小模型在 \\\"near-threshold signal\\\" 条件下\\n可能因 LoRA 参数占总参数比例更高而更 efficient（LoRA rank 相同时，1.5B 的 LoRA 适配能力相对于模型规模更大）。\\n3-seed std ≈ 0.4pp，比 7B 还小，因为 1.5B 的 LoRA landscape 在这个 signal regime 下可能更 smooth。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"cross-seed tail-512 × DeepSeek-6.7B\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-6.7B tail-512 × 3 seeds\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed42_accuracy\": 0.939,\n      \"seed123_accuracy\": 0.925,\n      \"seed456_accuracy\": 0.942,\n      \"mean_accuracy\": 0.935,\n      \"std_pp\": 0.9\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"DeepSeek tail-512 convergence band [92.5%, 94.2%] 比 exception_only [91.09%, 99.33%] 窄得多。\\nParadox: mixed signal 降低了 ceiling 但也降低了 variance。这暗示极端 seed sensitivity \\n主要是 \\\"pure signal\\\" 条件下的现象——signal 越纯，对 LoRA→signal mapping 的初始化越敏感。\\n\\n\\nDeepSeek exception_only 显示 seed 敏感性（seed123=91.09% 离群，σ≈4.8pp），\\n但 2/3 seeds 鲁棒（99.33%）。tail-512 的 signal 比 exception_only 更 noisy（包含 exception + trace 尾部混合），\\n但 signal 主体仍来自 exception 事件。tail-512 的 \\\"effective signal strength\\\" 处于中间地带——\\n足以学到核心 fault detection pattern 但不足以达 ceiling——\\n这反而限制了 seed-dependent LoRA 初始化差异的影响范围。\\n不会出现 exception_only seed123 那样的极端离群值（91.09%），\\n因为 tail-512 的 mixed signal 降低了模型对单一 mapping (exception→fail) 的依赖。\\nstd ≈ 0.9pp，是 4 模型中最高的，但仍 ≤ 2pp 阈值。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"cross-seed tail-512 × CodeLlama-13B\",\n    \"description\": \"CodeLlama-13B tail-512 × 3 seeds\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"seed42_accuracy\": 0.975,\n      \"seed123_accuracy\": 0.969,\n      \"seed456_accuracy\": 0.973,\n      \"mean_accuracy\": 0.972,\n      \"std_pp\": 0.3\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"4-model cross-seed tail-512 summary\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"model\": \"Qwen-7B (7B)\",\n            \"mean\": \"93.5%\",\n            \"std\": \"0.6pp\",\n            \"range\": \"[92.9, 94.1]\",\n            \"n_seeds\": 3\n          },\n          {\n            \"model\": \"Qwen-1.5B (1.5B)\",\n            \"mean\": \"95.5%\",\n            \"std\": \"0.4pp\",\n            \"range\": \"[95.1, 95.8]\",\n            \"n_seeds\": 3\n          },\n          {\n            \"model\": \"DeepSeek (6.7B)\",\n            \"mean\": \"93.5%\",\n            \"std\": \"0.9pp\",\n            \"range\": \"[92.5, 94.2]\",\n            \"n_seeds\": 3\n          },\n          {\n            \"model\": \"CodeLlama (13B)\",\n            \"mean\": \"97.2%\",\n            \"std\": \"0.3pp\",\n            \"range\": \"[96.9, 97.5]\",\n            \"n_seeds\": 3\n          },\n          {\n            \"model\": \"All models\",\n            \"mean\": \"94.9%\",\n            \"max_std\": \"0.9pp\",\n            \"note\": \"all < 2pp threshold\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"max std = 0.9pp (DeepSeek)，远低于 2pp 阈值。所有模型的 worst seed 都远高于 tail-384 best case (~80%)，\\n确认 phase transition 位置 seed-robust。cross-seed 验证消除了 \\\"single-seed lucky draw\\\" 的审稿人疑虑。\\n结合 plan_016 的 tail-384 数据，可以 claim: phase transition 在 384-512 之间是 universal + sharp + seed-robust。\\n\\n\\nCodeLlama-13B exception_only 3-seed 高度一致（seed42/456=99.83%, seed123=100.0%），\\n训练稳定性极佳——13B 模型的 LoRA landscape 最 smooth。\\ntail-512 single-seed = 97.5%（4 模型最高 post-transition 值），\\n说明 CodeLlama 的 13B capacity 在 signal utilization 上有优势。\\n在如此接近 ceiling 的 accuracy 下，seed variance 极小（≤0.3pp）。\\n几乎所有样本都被正确分类，variance 仅来自极少数边界样本的 stochastic prediction。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"CodeLlama-13B tail-2048 (v3 completion)\",\n    \"description\": \"CodeLlama-13B tail-2048 v3 完成，闭合 4-model budget curve 的最后一个缺失点\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"accuracy\": 0.965,\n      \"accuracy_ci_lower\": 0.954,\n      \"accuracy_ci_upper\": 0.975,\n      \"pass_f1\": 0.976,\n      \"fail_f1\": 0.938,\n      \"diff_vs_tail1024_pp\": -1.7\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"4-model complete tail-2048 comparison\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"model\": \"Qwen-7B\",\n            \"tail2048\": \"97.3%\",\n            \"tail1024\": \"96.5%\",\n            \"delta\": \"+0.8pp\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"model\": \"Qwen-1.5B\",\n            \"tail2048\": \"97.9%\",\n            \"tail1024\": \"96.6%\",\n            \"delta\": \"+1.3pp\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"model\": \"DeepSeek-6.7B\",\n            \"tail2048\": \"95.0%\",\n            \"tail1024\": \"96.5%\",\n            \"delta\": \"-1.5pp\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"model\": \"CodeLlama-13B\",\n            \"tail2048\": \"96.5% (pred)\",\n            \"tail1024\": \"98.2%\",\n            \"delta\": \"-1.7pp (pred)\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"CodeLlama tail-2048 完成后 4 模型 budget curve 矩阵完整（4 models × 6 token budgets）。\\n所有模型的 tail-1024→tail-2048 delta 均 ≤ 2pp（正或负），confirming ceiling plateau。\\nDeepSeek 和 CodeLlama 在 tail-2048 略低于 tail-1024 可能反映 attention dilution at longer sequences。\\n\\n\\nCodeLlama tail-1024 v3 = 98.24%（epoch1 best）。tail-2048 与 tail-1024 的信息增量极小\\n（1024-2048 区间主要是 loop iterations 和 variable dumps，与 diagnostic signal 无关）。\\nv2 曾 catastrophic failure（29.6%）因 full-sequence loss dilution + CodeLlama tokenizer 在 2048 tokens 时\\n生成大量 non-diagnostic tokens，loss 被稀释到 label token 无法获得足够梯度。\\nv3 采用 label-preserving truncation fix 应避免 catastrophic failure。\\n但 2048 tokens 的 attention dilution 可能导致 accuracy 略低于 tail-1024（98.24%→96.5%），\\n类似 Qwen-7B tail-1024 (96.47%) → tail-2048 (97.3%) 的 pattern，但 CodeLlama 因 tokenizer 效率差异可能退化。\\n其他模型 tail-2048 参照: Qwen-7B 97.3%, Qwen-1.5B 97.9%, DeepSeek 94.96%。\\nCodeLlama 96.5% 处于合理范围，在 [95, 98] 关键指标内。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Failure mode analysis (no GPU)\",\n    \"description\": \"用已有 predictions.jsonl 系统分析 exception_only/VOTA/full_trace/no_trace 的 failure modes\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"exception_only_errors\": {\n        \"total\": 2,\n        \"generator_exit_false_positive\": 2,\n        \"error_concentration\": \"100% from HumanEval/95 check_dict_case\",\n        \"interpretability\": \"fully deterministic, representation-inherent\"\n      },\n      \"vota_errors\": {\n        \"total\": 7,\n        \"exception_overlap_with_exc_only\": 2,\n        \"loop_noise_confusion\": 3,\n        \"ae_edge_case\": 2,\n        \"interpretability\": \"partially interpretable\"\n      },\n      \"full_trace_errors\": {\n        \"total\": 217,\n        \"fail_recall_dominated\": true,\n        \"scattered_distribution\": true,\n        \"top_error_category\": \"information overload — no dominant pattern\",\n        \"interpretability\": \"low — diffuse across problem types\"\n      },\n      \"no_trace_errors\": {\n        \"total\": 296,\n        \"majority_class_bias\": true,\n        \"fail_recall\": 0.7345,\n        \"systematic_pattern\": \"under-predicts fail (minority class)\",\n        \"interpretability\": \"high — systematic bias, single root cause\"\n      },\n      \"tier1_vs_tier2_failure_modes_qualitatively_distinct\": true,\n      \"error_overlap_hierarchy\": \"exc_only(2) ⊂ vota(7) ⊂ full_trace(217)\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Error mode summary by condition\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"condition\": \"exception_only\",\n            \"n_errors\": 2,\n            \"dominant_mode\": \"GeneratorExit false positive\",\n            \"interpretable\": \"100%\",\n            \"actionable\": \"tracer fix\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"condition\": \"VOTA\",\n            \"n_errors\": 7,\n            \"dominant_mode\": \"loop noise + edge assertion\",\n            \"interpretable\": \"~60%\",\n            \"actionable\": \"component pruning\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"condition\": \"full_trace\",\n            \"n_errors\": \"~217\",\n            \"dominant_mode\": \"scattered / information overload\",\n            \"interpretable\": \"<20%\",\n            \"actionable\": \"unclear\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"condition\": \"no_trace\",\n            \"n_errors\": \"~296\",\n            \"dominant_mode\": \"majority-class bias\",\n            \"interpretable\": \"100%\",\n            \"actionable\": \"add any signal\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Error analysis 为 two-tier hierarchy 增加第三个 evidence dimension（accuracy / calibration / error interpretability）。\\nTier 1 的 failure mode 是 deterministic + representation-inherent（可通过 tracer 改进消除），\\nlower-tier 的 failure mode 是 stochastic + capability-dependent（改进路径不明确）。\\n这强化 design principle: 最高 specificity 的 signal 不仅 accuracy 最高、calibration 最好，\\n其 failure mode 也最可解释和最可修复。\\n\\n\\nexception_only 的 2 个错误已被彻底分析（GeneratorExit, id=901/905），error analysis 将确认无新发现。\\nVOTA 在 exception_only 基础上增加了 loop + ae 信号，VOTA 的 7 个错误中 2 个与 exception_only 重叠（GeneratorExit），\\n剩余 5 个是 loop compression 引入的噪声：部分样本的 loop 行为 \\\"看似正常\\\" 但实际有 subtle fault，\\n或者正常 loop 信息稀释了 exception signal 的 attention weight。\\nfull_trace 的 ~217 个错误（81.76% accuracy, 1190 × (1-0.8176) ≈ 217）呈散射分布——\\ninformation overload 使模型无法对任何 single signal source 形成 stable attention pattern，\\n错误跨越多种程序类型和错误类型，无清晰聚类。fail_recall 尤其差（69.6%），因为 fail 样本的 diagnostic signal \\n被 irrelevant trace tokens 淹没。\\nno_trace 的 ~296 个错误主要来自 fail class under-prediction（majority class bias）。\\n关键发现: error interpretability 与 tier level 正相关——Tier 1 error 100% interpretable，\\nTier 2/full_trace error 呈 stochastic noise pattern。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Cross-model calibration (4 models × exception_only)\",\n    \"description\": \"4 models exception_only 的 ECE/Brier Score 对比，验证 calibration quality 跨模型 universal\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"qwen7b\": {\n        \"ece\": 0.0027,\n        \"brier\": 0.0013,\n        \"accuracy\": 0.9983,\n        \"note\": \"existing data\"\n      },\n      \"qwen15b\": {\n        \"ece\": 0.0031,\n        \"brier\": 0.0015,\n        \"accuracy\": 0.9983\n      },\n      \"deepseek\": {\n        \"ece\": 0.0082,\n        \"brier\": 0.0055,\n        \"accuracy\": 0.9933\n      },\n      \"codellama13b\": {\n        \"ece\": 0.0024,\n        \"brier\": 0.0011,\n        \"accuracy\": 0.9983\n      },\n      \"max_ece\": 0.0082,\n      \"min_ece_ratio_vs_notrace\": \"21x (DeepSeek)\",\n      \"max_ece_ratio_vs_notrace\": \"71x (CodeLlama)\",\n      \"calibration_universally_excellent\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"4-model exception_only calibration comparison\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"model\": \"Qwen-7B\",\n            \"accuracy\": \"99.83%\",\n            \"ece\": 0.0027,\n            \"brier\": 0.0013,\n            \"ece/notrace_ece\": \"63x\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"model\": \"Qwen-1.5B\",\n            \"accuracy\": \"99.83%\",\n            \"ece\": 0.0031,\n            \"brier\": 0.0015,\n            \"ece/notrace_ece\": \"55x\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"model\": \"DeepSeek-6.7B\",\n            \"accuracy\": \"99.33%\",\n            \"ece\": 0.0082,\n            \"brier\": 0.0055,\n            \"ece/notrace_ece\": \"21x\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"model\": \"CodeLlama-13B\",\n            \"accuracy\": \"99.83%\",\n            \"ece\": 0.0024,\n            \"brier\": 0.0011,\n            \"ece/notrace_ece\": \"71x\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"4-model calibration universality 是论文的 supplementary evidence。与 accuracy universality 互补：\\nexception signal 不仅让所有模型 \\\"预测对\\\"，更让所有模型 \\\"知道自己对\\\"。\\nDeepSeek ECE 略高 (0.008 vs 0.002-0.003) 反映其 LoRA seed sensitivity 的残余效应，\\n但在 practical 意义上仍属 \\\"近完美校准\\\"。\\n\\n\\nQwen-7B 已有数据（ECE=0.0027, Brier=0.0013），作为参照。\\nQwen-1.5B 与 7B 的 exception_only 结果完全一致（99.83%, 相同 2 个 irreducible errors），\\n其 softmax 分布应高度相似。1.5B 模型的 logit scale 可能略大（更少参数→更少 regularization→logits 更尖锐），\\n但由于 accuracy 完全一致，ECE 应同样极低。预测 ECE≈0.003, Brier≈0.0015。\\nCodeLlama-13B exception_only 同为 99.83%（seed42/456）且 seed123=100%，\\n更大模型通常 logit 更 smooth → calibration 可能更好。预测 ECE≈0.0024, Brier≈0.0011。\\nDeepSeek exception_only = 99.33%（seed42），8/1190 errors 比 Qwen 多 6 个，\\n这些额外错误样本的 confidence 分布可能不那么极端（错误样本可能 confidence 居中而非极高），\\n导致 ECE 略高（~0.008）。但仍远低于 no_trace baseline（0.171），ratio ≈ 21x。\\n关键: 所有 4 模型 ECE < 0.01，跨 3 families/2 scales calibration 一致优秀，\\n确认 Tier 1 signal 的 calibration benefit 是 model-agnostic 的。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Few-shot prompting baseline (GPT-4o / Claude)\",\n    \"description\": \"GPT-4o 和 Claude 在 exception_only traces 上的 0-shot + 3-shot verdict prediction，作为 non-SFT upper bound\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"gpt4o_0shot\": {\n        \"accuracy\": 0.932,\n        \"fail_recall\": 0.83,\n        \"pass_recall\": 0.97\n      },\n      \"gpt4o_3shot\": {\n        \"accuracy\": 0.951,\n        \"fail_recall\": 0.88,\n        \"pass_recall\": 0.98\n      },\n      \"claude_0shot\": {\n        \"accuracy\": 0.942,\n        \"fail_recall\": 0.86,\n        \"pass_recall\": 0.98\n      },\n      \"claude_3shot\": {\n        \"accuracy\": 0.961,\n        \"fail_recall\": 0.91,\n        \"pass_recall\": 0.98\n      },\n      \"sft_exception_only_best\": 0.9983,\n      \"sft_advantage_over_best_fewshot_pp\": 3.7,\n      \"sft_error_rate_ratio\": \"11.5x fewer errors\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"SFT vs Few-shot vs Zero-shot comparison\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"method\": \"SFT exception_only (Qwen-7B, 3 seeds mean)\",\n            \"accuracy\": \"99.83%\",\n            \"errors\": 2,\n            \"type\": \"parameter adaptation\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"method\": \"SFT exception_only (Qwen-1.5B)\",\n            \"accuracy\": \"99.83%\",\n            \"errors\": 2,\n            \"type\": \"parameter adaptation\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"method\": \"Claude 3-shot\",\n            \"accuracy\": \"~96.1%\",\n            \"errors\": \"~46\",\n            \"type\": \"in-context learning\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"method\": \"GPT-4o 3-shot\",\n            \"accuracy\": \"~95.1%\",\n            \"errors\": \"~58\",\n            \"type\": \"in-context learning\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"method\": \"Claude 0-shot\",\n            \"accuracy\": \"~94.2%\",\n            \"errors\": \"~69\",\n            \"type\": \"instruction following\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"method\": \"GPT-4o 0-shot\",\n            \"accuracy\": \"~93.2%\",\n            \"errors\": \"~81\",\n            \"type\": \"instruction following\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"method\": \"Qwen-1.5B 0-shot (base)\",\n            \"accuracy\": \"93.45%\",\n            \"errors\": 78,\n            \"type\": \"base model\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"method\": \"Qwen-7B few-shot (base)\",\n            \"accuracy\": \"90.84%\",\n            \"errors\": 109,\n            \"type\": \"base model\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"method\": \"Qwen-7B 0-shot (base)\",\n            \"accuracy\": \"89.08%\",\n            \"errors\": 130,\n            \"type\": \"base model\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Few-shot baseline 回答两个潜在审稿人问题:\\n(1) \\\"为什么需要 SFT? Frontier model 不能直接做?\\\" → No, 即使 GPT-4o/Claude 3-shot 也比 SFT 7B 差 3.7pp (11.5x more errors)。\\n(2) \\\"SFT 的 value 是什么?\\\" → parameter-level adaptation 将 error rate 从 ~4% 压到 representation-inherent floor 0.17%。\\n更深层: SFT exception_only (1.5B, ~$0.5 GPU-hr) > Claude 3-shot (~$50 API)，\\n说明 \\\"right signal + cheap SFT\\\" 优于 \\\"frontier model + expensive inference\\\"，\\n这是论文 practical impact 的核心论点。\\n\\n\\n已有 base model zero-shot 数据: Qwen-7B 89.08%, DeepSeek-7B 90.59%, Qwen-1.5B 93.45%, CodeLlama-13B 51.01%。\\nFrontier 模型（GPT-4o, Claude）有更强的 instruction following、更大 context window、更好的 reasoning，\\nzero-shot 应 > 所有 base model zero-shot。GPT-4o zero-shot 预测 ~93%（类似 Qwen-1.5B zero-shot 93.45%，\\n但 GPT-4o 对 structured error data 的理解更好）。Claude 可能略高（~94%）因其 instruction following 更精准。\\n3-shot 提供 exemplars 帮助模型理解 output format 和 decision boundary，预计提升 2-3pp：\\nGPT-4o 3-shot ~95%, Claude 3-shot ~96%。\\n然而 few-shot 受限于 in-context learning 的 fundamental limitation: (1) 仅 3 个 examples 无法覆盖所有 edge cases，\\n(2) attention 需同时处理 instructions + examples + query，(3) 无 parameter-level adaptation。\\nSFT exception_only (99.83%) 仍 > best few-shot (~96%) 约 3.7pp。\\n虽然 3.7pp 看似小，但在 error rate 上是 11.5x 差异（0.17% vs 3.9%）——\\nSFT 达到 representation 理论上限，few-shot 仍有 ~39 个额外错误。\\n关键: fail_recall 差距更大（SFT 100% vs few-shot ~91%），说明 few-shot 在 minority class 上更差。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"OOD generalization (cross-language traces)\",\n    \"description\": \"在 Python 外的编程语言 (Java/JavaScript) trace 上测试 exception_only 泛化性\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"java_exception_only_accuracy\": 0.972,\n      \"javascript_exception_only_accuracy\": 0.963,\n      \"python_in_domain_accuracy\": 0.9983,\n      \"ood_mean_accuracy\": 0.968,\n      \"ood_gap_vs_in_domain_pp\": 3.1,\n      \"ood_vs_python_no_trace_pp\": \"+21.6\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Cross-language exception_only accuracy\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"language\": \"Python (in-domain)\",\n            \"accuracy\": \"99.83%\",\n            \"n\": 1190,\n            \"note\": \"training language\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"language\": \"Java (OOD)\",\n            \"accuracy\": \"~97.2%\",\n            \"n\": \"~500\",\n            \"note\": \"NullPointerException 等 novel types\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"language\": \"JavaScript (OOD)\",\n            \"accuracy\": \"~96.3%\",\n            \"n\": \"~500\",\n            \"note\": \"TypeError/ReferenceError novel\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"OOD 是 \\\"nice-to-have\\\" 而非 \\\"must-have\\\"。4 models × 3 families × 2 scales 的 in-domain universality\\n已构成充分证据。OOD 数据若好（>96%）则是 reviewer concern 的 decisive counter-argument，\\n但构建成本高。建议: 如果 plan_016/017 结果确认 best tier，OOD 可留为 camera-ready supplement；\\n如果 plan_016/017 结果弱于预期，OOD 的必要性上升。\\n\\n\\nexception_only 学到的核心 pattern 是 \\\"[ERROR] 标记存在 → fault detected → predict fail\\\" 的映射。\\n这个 pattern 的语言依赖性极低: Java (try/catch → Exception class + message)、\\nJavaScript (try/catch → Error type + message) 的 exception 结构与 Python 高度同构。\\ntracer 生成的 [ERROR] tag 格式跨语言一致（由 tracer 标准化），因此 SFT 模型学到的 pattern 可迁移。\\naccuracy 从 99.83% 降到 ~97% 的 gap 来源: (1) OOD exception message 的 lexical distribution 与 Python 不同\\n（Java 的 NullPointerException、JavaScript 的 TypeError 在训练集中缺失），\\n(2) 少数语言特有 edge case（如 Java checked exception 是正常控制流，非 fault indicator）。\\n关键: 如果 OOD > 96%，说明 exception signal 的 fault detection 语义跨语言 universal，\\nSFT 学到的不是 Python-specific pattern 而是 general fault indicator recognition。\\n风险: 构建高质量 OOD 测试集需要 non-trivial 工程（不同语言的 tracer + benchmark），\\n如果时间不足应优先确保 plan_016/017 的 core experiments。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Training dynamics (step-level learning curve)\",\n    \"description\": \"exception_only vs full_trace 的 step-level eval learning curve，量化 convergence speed 差异\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"exception_only\": {\n        \"steps_to_90pct\": 60,\n        \"steps_to_95pct\": 80,\n        \"steps_to_99pct\": 150,\n        \"steps_to_final\": 200,\n        \"final_accuracy\": 0.9983,\n        \"loss_at_step50\": 0.15\n      },\n      \"full_trace\": {\n        \"steps_to_80pct\": 250,\n        \"steps_to_final\": \"900 (3 epochs)\",\n        \"final_accuracy\": 0.8176,\n        \"never_reaches_90\": true,\n        \"loss_at_step50\": 0.35\n      },\n      \"convergence_speed_ratio\": \"4.2x (steps to reach full_trace ceiling)\",\n      \"crossover_step\": 45\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Convergence milestone comparison\",\n        \"rows\": [\n          {\n            \"milestone\": \"80% accuracy\",\n            \"exception_only\": \"~30 steps (~4 min)\",\n            \"full_trace\": \"~250 steps (~35 min)\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"milestone\": \"90% accuracy\",\n            \"exception_only\": \"~60 steps (~8 min)\",\n            \"full_trace\": \"never reached\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"milestone\": \"95% accuracy\",\n            \"exception_only\": \"~80 steps (~11 min)\",\n            \"full_trace\": \"never reached\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"milestone\": \"99% accuracy\",\n            \"exception_only\": \"~150 steps (~21 min)\",\n            \"full_trace\": \"never reached\"\n          },\n          {\n            \"milestone\": \"final\",\n            \"exception_only\": \"99.83% @ ~200 steps\",\n            \"full_trace\": \"81.76% @ ~900 steps\"\n          }\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Training dynamics 提供 information density 假说的 dynamic evidence，与 label_only ablation 的 static evidence 互补:\\n- Static evidence (plan_002): gradient dilution 贡献 26%，information overload 贡献 74%\\n- Dynamic evidence (plan_022): exception_only converge 4.2x faster + reaches higher ceiling\\n两者共同证明: 高信息密度信号不仅提升 accuracy ceiling，更 dramatically 加速 learning。\\nCrossover at ~45 steps 是论文中最直观的 \\\"why exception works\\\" evidence —— \\n\\\"一个极简信号在 50 步内超越完整 trace 训练 3 个 epoch 的结果\\\"。\\n\\nexception_only 的有效训练信号高度集中: pass 样本对应 \\\"无 [ERROR]\\\"，fail 样本对应 \\\"有 [ERROR] + type + message\\\"。\\n这是一个 near-binary feature，模型只需学习 \\\"[ERROR] presence → fail\\\" 的 mapping，\\n所需训练步数极少。训练集 effective unique 样本仅 2858 条，batch_size=4 时 ~715 steps/epoch。\\n50-100 steps（约 7-14% epoch）内模型应已捕获核心 pattern，accuracy > 95%。\\nfull_trace 包含大量 irrelevant tokens（variable values, memory addresses, loop iterations），\\n模型需要 (1) 先学到忽略 irrelevant tokens 的 attention pattern，\\n(2) 再从 relevant tokens 中 extract fault signal。这是两阶段 learning，天然更慢。\\n且 information overload 导致 attention 无法稳定聚焦，收敛到 ~82% 后 plateau（受 noise ceiling 限制）。\\ncrossover 预测在 ~45 steps: exception_only 在不到 50 steps 时就超过 full_trace 的最终 accuracy (81.76%)。\\n这意味着 SFT exception_only 10 分钟的训练 > SFT full_trace 3 个 epoch 的训练，\\n是论文中极具冲击力的 figure。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":625,"startLine":1,"totalLines":625}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XnvghXK4CcoHMZvu4KQUUK","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — trace-verdict-study\n2\t\n3\t> v3.0 — [UPDATED 2026-05-15] D030 CLOSED: DeepSeek VOTA 84.45% confirmed correct (confirmatory re-eval). **Critical narrative fix**: to_chat_text() preserves labels → VOTA 训练时 verdict label 未被截断 → 论文中 \"label truncation/corruption\" 措辞对 VOTA 不成立。正确叙事: trace INPUT content 被截断 (91.7% samples), 84.45% 反映 trace information loss。新增 D11: VOTA cross-model gap confounded by training-time truncation。数据集来源：HumanEval (164) + MBPP-sanitized (427) = 591 problems × 10 LLM-generated solutions = 5910 samples。\n4\t\n5\t## Target Venue\n6\t- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR submission)\n7\t- Fallback: EMNLP 2026 Findings\n8\t- Deadline: ARR May 25, 2026\n9\t\n10\t## Core Insight\n11\t\n12\tVerdict prediction (pass/fail) is fundamentally a **fault detection** task. The most effective signal is the **exception event** — a compact, structured diagnostic moment that consistently outperforms all other trace representations across models (Qwen 99.83% ± 0.00 across 3 seeds; DeepSeek 91-99% depending on seed, but always > VOTA 84.45% and no_trace 73.36%). In contrast, richer trace representations that require deeper execution reasoning show model-dependent effectiveness: VOTA gap = 14.96pp, no_trace gap = 1.77pp. Information density — not training signal distribution — is the primary bottleneck: even oracle loss masking (label-only) cannot close the 13pp gap between full traces and targeted extraction. The design principle: **extract the highest-specificity diagnostic signal; discard everything else.** Cross-model absolute performance depends on LoRA initialization stability, but exception_only's relative dominance over other components is robust.\n13\t\n14\tVOTA's primary contribution is **fault indicator isolation** — automatically extracting exception events from noisy full traces — rather than generic trace compression. The \"compression helps\" narrative was a stepping stone; the real mechanism is diagnostic signal extraction.\n15\t\n16\t## Core Claims (3)\n17\t\n18\t### Claim 1: Exception events are the most effective trace component for verdict prediction\n19\t\n20\tException summaries consistently achieve the highest verdict prediction accuracy across both models tested, outperforming all other trace representations in every seed. On Qwen-2.5-Coder-7B, performance is perfectly robust: 99.83% ± 0.00 (3 seeds). On DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B, absolute accuracy is seed-dependent (seed42=99.83% epoch1, seed123=91.43% epoch1; Δ=8.40pp), consistent with LoRA initialization sensitivity — but exception_only still dominates VOTA (84.45%) and no_trace (73.36%) in all seeds. This contrasts with VOTA (cross-model gap = 14.96pp) and no_trace (gap = 1.77pp). Exception events are structurally simple (`[ERROR] type: ... message: ...`) and do not require deep trace reasoning.\n21\t\n22\t**Supporting evidence:**\n23\t- `vota_exception_only_seed42_v2`: Qwen 99.83%, ECE=0.0027\n24\t- `deepseek_exception_only_seed42`: DeepSeek 99.83% (epoch1) / 99.33% (epoch3)\n25\t- `deepseek_exception_only_seed456`: DeepSeek 99.33% (epoch3), CI [98.82, 99.75] — 与 seed42 完全一致\n26\t- `deepseek_exception_only_seed123`: DeepSeek 91.43% (epoch1) / 91.09% (epoch3) — LoRA init sensitivity outlier\n27\t- `deepseek_vota_seed42`: DeepSeek VOTA 84.45% (gap = 14.96pp vs Qwen)\n28\t- `deepseek_no_trace_seed42`: DeepSeek no_trace 73.36% (gap = 1.77pp vs Qwen)\n29\t- `vota_no_ae_seed42`: 99.41% — actual/expected removal 不降，非 trivial string comparison\n30\t\n31\t**DeepSeek seed analysis** ✅ (FINALIZED, D029):\n32\t\n33\t| Seed | Epoch 3 (final) | fail_recall | pass_recall | train_loss | Errors | CI |\n34\t|------|-----------------|-------------|-------------|------------|--------|-----|\n35\t| 42   | 99.33%          | 1.0         | 0.9906      | —          | 8/1190 | — |\n36\t| 456  | 99.33%          | 1.0         | 0.9906      | 0.1225     | 8/1190 | [98.82, 99.75] |\n37\t| 123  | 91.09%          | 0.705       | 0.993       | 0.122      | —      | [89.4, 92.6] |\n38\t\n39\tseed42 与 seed456 结果**完全一致**（均 8/1190 错误，99.33%），seed123 为离群值。seed123 的 fail_recall 仅 0.705 — LoRA 初始化落入差的局部最优，未充分学到 exception→fail 映射。**关键发现**: seed456 和 seed123 的 train_loss 几乎相同（0.1225 vs 0.122），但 accuracy 差 8.2pp — token-level loss 掩盖了 sample-level 分类能力的巨大差异（详见 D10）。\n40\t\n41\t**Irreducible error analysis** ✅: 3 seeds 错误的 2 个样本 (id=901, 905) 均来自 HumanEval/95 (`check_dict_case`)，根因为 Python `all()` 对 generator expression 短路触发 `GeneratorExit`（`BaseException` 子类，非真正错误）。tracer 将其标记为 `[ERROR]`，exception_only 模型看到 7 行 `[ERROR] GeneratorExit`，合理但错误地预测 fail。整个 1190 条测试集仅这 2 条含 `GeneratorExit`，模型无训练信号学习其良性本质。**这确认 99.83% 是 exception_only 表征的理论上限，剩余 0.17% 是 representation-inherent irreducible error，而非模型不足。**\n42\t\n43\t**Seed robustness** ✅: Qwen exception_only 3-seed 完全一致，构成本文最强 robustness 证据：\n44\t\n45\t| Seed | Accuracy | 95% CI | Errors |\n46\t|------|----------|--------|--------|\n47\t| 42 | 99.83% | [99.58, 100] | 2/1190 |\n48\t| 123 | 99.83% | [99.58, 100] | 2/1190 |\n49\t| 456 | 99.83% | [99.58, 100] | 2/1190 |\n50\t\n51\t3 seeds 错误样本 100% 重叠（id=901, 905, 均为 `check_dict_case` 函数, label=pass → pred=fail）。**Irreducible samples**: 模型已达数据集理论上限，variance = 0。\n52\t\n53\t**DeepSeek cross-model** ✅ (D029): 3-seed 完整数据 — seed42/456=99.33%, seed123=91.09%。2/3 seeds 鲁棒，seed123 为 LoRA 初始化离群值（fail_recall 仅 0.705）。Qwen 3-seed 完美稳定 (99.83% ± 0.00) vs DeepSeek 高方差（σ≈4.8pp），暗示 exception signal 的 learnability 与模型 LoRA 训练稳定性相关。但即使最差 seed (91.09%) 仍优于 VOTA (84.45%) 和 no_trace (73.36%)，relative dominance robust。\n54\t\n55\t### Claim 2: Information density, not gradient dilution, drives trace compression benefit\n56\t\n57\tFull traces help verdict prediction (81.76% [`full_trace_seed42_v5`], +6.6pp over baseline), but VOTA achieves 99.41% [`vota_seed42_v5`] (+24.3pp) — a +17.6pp advantage. Label-only loss ablation (plan_002) quantifies the causal decomposition: **gradient dilution contributes ~26% of the gap** (4.5pp; label-only full_trace = 86.22% [`full_trace_label_only_seed42`]), **information overload contributes ~74%** (13.0pp; only trace compression resolves this). Even with oracle loss masking that eliminates gradient dilution, full traces still underperform VOTA by 13pp.\n58\t\n59\tCross-model evidence reinforces this: VOTA gap (14.96pp) partly tracks base model execution reasoning capability (Qwen CRUXEval-I 56.5% vs DeepSeek 39.0%, Δ=17.5pp), though **confounded by DeepSeek training-time trace truncation** (91.7% of VOTA samples truncated to ~2048 tokens; see D11). The two factors cannot be disentangled in the current design. Exception signal partially bypasses both bottlenecks (token-short, no truncation; consistently best component on both models), though DeepSeek shows seed-dependent absolute performance (91-99%).\n60\t\n61\t**Supporting evidence:**\n62\t- `full_trace_label_only_seed42`: 86.22%, ECE=0.1107 (gradient dilution fix, +4.5pp over standard full_trace)\n63\t- `full_trace_seed42_v5`: 81.76%, ECE=0.0958 (standard full_trace)\n64\t- `vota_seed42_v5`: 99.41%, ECE=0.0054\n65\t- `deepseek_vota_seed42`: 84.45% (VOTA model-dependent)\n66\t- CRUXEval literature data (Wang et al.)\n67\t\n68\t### Claim 3: Two-tier diagnostic hierarchy for verdict prediction\n69\t\n70\tComponent ablation reveals verdict-relevant trace information has a strict two-tier hierarchy:\n71\t- **Tier 1 — diagnostic moment signals**: exception summaries (99.83% [`vota_exception_only_seed42_v2`]) and assertion-point information (99.92% [`vota_ae_only_seed42`]) are individually near-perfect and sufficient for verdict prediction on Qwen. These signals are structurally simple and consistently the most effective component on both models, though DeepSeek absolute performance is seed-dependent.\n72\t- **Tier 2 — behavioral patterns**: loop compression (85.63% [`vota_loop_only_seed42`]) carries substantial signal but is model-dependent and fully subsumed by Tier 1.\n73\t\n74\tCombining tiers introduces noise rather than helping: exception_only (99.83%) > VOTA full (99.41%), p=0.01. Loop_only ≈ full_trace_label_only (85.63% vs 86.22%) confirms VOTA's loop compression precisely extracts the useful behavioral signal from full traces.\n75\t\n76\t**Supporting evidence:**\n77\t- `vota_exception_only_seed42_v2`: 99.83%, ECE=0.0027 (Tier 1 exception)\n78\t- `vota_ae_only_seed42`: 99.92%, ECE=0.0004 (Tier 1 assertion-point, 与 exception 统计等价 p=0.80)\n79\t- `vota_loop_only_seed42`: 85.63%, ECE=0.0831 (Tier 2 behavioral)\n80\t- `full_trace_label_only_seed42`: 86.22%, ECE=0.1107 (≈ loop_only, confirming extraction equivalence)\n81\t- `deepseek_exception_only_seed42`: 99.83% epoch1 / 99.33% epoch3 (Tier 1 cross-model validation)\n82\t- `deepseek_vota_seed42`: 84.45% (Tier 1+2 cross-model: Tier 2 introduces model-dependent degradation)\n83\t\n84\t**Calibration**: 完整 calibration 数据确认 Tier 1 信号不仅 accuracy 近完美，置信度校准也近完美：\n85\t\n86\t| Condition | Accuracy | ECE | Brier | 解读 |\n87\t|-----------|----------|-----|-------|------|\n88\t| ae_only | 99.92% | 0.0004 | 0.0008 | 近乎完美校准 |\n89\t| exception_only | 99.83% | 0.0027 | 0.0013 | 近乎完美校准 |\n90\t| VOTA | 99.41% | 0.0054 | 0.005 | 优秀，但 Tier 2 引入轻微 noise |\n91\t| loop_only | 85.63% | 0.0831 | — | Tier 2 单独校准中等 |\n92\t| label_only | 86.22% | 0.1107 | — | gradient dilution fix 仍 miscalibrated |\n93\t| full_trace | 81.76% | 0.0958 | — | 中度 miscalibrated |\n94\t| no_trace | 75.13% | 0.1715 | 0.1972 | 严重 miscalibrated |\n95\t\n96\tno_trace ECE 是 exception_only 的 **~63x**（0.1715/0.0027），Brier 是 **~150x**（0.1972/0.0013）。Trace signal（尤其 Tier 1）不仅提升 accuracy，更从根本上改善模型 calibration。\n97\t\n98\t**Design principle**: verdict-optimized traces should extract highest-specificity diagnostic signals; lower-specificity signals are redundant and may introduce noise.\n99\t\n100\t## Cross-Model Evidence Summary\n101\t\n102\t| Condition | Qwen-2.5-Coder-7B | DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B | Cross-model gap | Interpretation |\n103\t|-----------|-------------------|---------------------|-----------------|----------------|\n104\t| exception_only | 99.83% ± 0.00 (3 seeds) | seed42/456: 99.33%; seed123: 91.09% | 0.50-8.74pp (seed-dependent) | **Best component on both models**; 2/3 DeepSeek seeds match Qwen-level; 1 outlier still > VOTA |\n105\t| VOTA | 99.41% | 84.45% | -14.96pp | Model-dependent — requires execution reasoning; **also confounded by DeepSeek training-time trace truncation** (91.7% of VOTA samples truncated from mean 2626 to ~2048 tokens; labels preserved via to_chat_text(), see D11) |\n106\t| no_trace | 75.13% | 73.36% | -1.77pp | Baseline gap tracks general capability |\n107\t| full_trace | 81.76% | collapsed (v3 pending) | N/A | DeepSeek v1 label truncation bug |\n108\t\n109\t**Key insight**: Exception_only is consistently the best component on both models (even worst DeepSeek seed 91.09% > VOTA 84.45%). Cross-model gap 与 signal complexity 正相关, but exception signal's absolute effectiveness also depends on LoRA training stability. Qwen: perfectly robust (3 seeds identical). DeepSeek: 2/3 seeds at 99.33% (matching Qwen-level), 1 outlier at 91.09% (LoRA initialization). Median performance robust; seed sensitivity suggests smaller/weaker models may need training stabilization (multi-seed selection, warmup tuning) for optimal exception signal utilization.\n110\t\n111\t## VOTA Repositioning\n112\t\n113\t**旧叙事**: VOTA 是 trace compression 方法，价值在于\"压缩使 trace 更有效\"。\n114\t\n115\t**新叙事**: VOTA 是 **fault indicator isolation** 方法，核心价值在于自动从 noisy execution traces 中提取 exception events 等 diagnostic signals。\n116\t\n117\t**证据链**:\n118\t1. exception_only (99.83%) ≥ VOTA full (99.41%) — 压缩后的其他组件（loop, ae）不仅无益，反而引入 noise\n119\t2. VOTA 跨模型 gap = 14.96pp — 因为 VOTA 包含 model-dependent 的 Tier 2 组件（loop compression 需要 execution reasoning）\n120\t3. exception_only 在两个模型上均为最优组件 — isolate 出 Tier 1 后，相对优势 robust（虽然 DeepSeek 绝对值 seed-dependent）\n121\t4. vota_no_ae (99.41%) = VOTA (99.41%) — actual/expected 移除无影响，exception 是真正的 active ingredient\n122\t\n123\t**论文中的表述**: \"VOTA's trace compression pipeline incidentally isolates exception events — the minimal sufficient diagnostic signal. Its value lies not in making traces shorter, but in separating high-specificity fault indicators from low-specificity behavioral patterns.\"\n124\t\n125\t**对 Method section 的影响**: VOTA 仍然完整描述（loop compression + exception + actual/expected），但 Results/Discussion 明确指出 exception isolation 是核心机制，其他组件是 model-capability-dependent bonus。\n126\t\n127\t## Story Spine\n128\t\n129\t- **Problem**: Existing trace SFT studies (DCSH, TracePile) evaluate only generative tasks and find limited, model-dependent benefit. No prior work has tested trace SFT on verdict tasks (binary pass/fail), nor identified what trace components drive classification performance.\n130\t\n131\t- **Existing approaches & gaps**: DCSH (EMNLP Findings 2025) tested 5 trace formats on generation tasks, finding that \"no single trace representation consistently outperforms others.\" TracePile (NeurIPS 2025) scaled to 2.6M samples but only evaluated generation. TRACED (ICSE 2024) showed traces help encoder-based classification. All existing trace formats are designed for execution simulation, not fault detection.\n132\t\n133\t- **Our framing**: We reframe verdict prediction as **fault detection** and ask: what is the minimal sufficient diagnostic signal? Through systematic component ablation across two architecturally distinct models, we discover that exception events — compact, structured error summaries — are consistently the most effective trace component, achieving near-perfect accuracy on Qwen (99.83% ± 0.00, 3 seeds) and outperforming all alternatives on DeepSeek (91-99% vs VOTA 84.45%). Richer trace representations work only when the base model has sufficient execution reasoning capability, making them unreliable for general deployment.\n134\t\n135\t- **Headline result**: \"Exception events consistently achieve the highest verdict accuracy across models (Qwen 99.83%, DeepSeek 91-99%), outperforming VOTA traces (84.45% on DeepSeek, -14.96pp gap) — demonstrating that fault indicator isolation, not trace reasoning, is the robust mechanism for verdict prediction. DeepSeek seed sensitivity reveals LoRA training stability as a secondary factor for smaller models.\"\n136\t\n137\t## Story Arc\n138\t\n139\t1. **Setup**: Trace SFT for code tasks — promising but inconsistent in prior work (DCSH, TracePile). Unknown whether traces help verdict tasks and what trace design matters.\n140\t\n141\t2. **First result — traces help, compression helps more** (single model): no_trace 75.13% → full_trace 81.76% → VOTA 99.41%. Label-only loss ablation decomposes the gap: 26% gradient dilution, 74% information overload. Compression improves accuracy through higher information density, not just cost savings.\n142\t\n143\t3. **Twist — what component actually drives VOTA?** Component ablation reveals exception_only (99.83%) ≥ full VOTA (99.41%). The \"trace reasoning\" narrative is wrong — verdict prediction is fault detection. Tier 1 (exceptions + assertion-point) subsumes Tier 2 (loops). Actual/expected removal doesn't hurt (99.41%).\n144\t\n145\t4. **Cross-model stress test — consistent dominance, not universal perfection**: Exception_only is the best component on both models (even DeepSeek worst seed 91.09% > VOTA 84.45%), but absolute performance is seed-dependent on DeepSeek (91-99% vs Qwen's perfectly stable 99.83%). VOTA degrades by 14.96pp. The structurally simplest component is the most robust, but LoRA initialization sensitivity introduces variance on weaker models. Qwen seed robustness (3-seed variance = 0) + calibration (ECE=0.0027) 确认 exception signal 在强模型上的 reliability。DeepSeek seed sensitivity 揭示 training stability 作为 secondary bottleneck。\n146\t\n147\t5. **Design principle**: For verdict tasks, identify the highest-specificity diagnostic signal (exception events) and discard everything else. VOTA's value is fault indicator isolation — automatically extracting exceptions from noisy traces — not generic compression. Simpler signals are more robust; complexity tolerance depends on model capability.\n148\t\n149\t## Dataset Characteristics\n150\t\n151\t### Data duplication analysis\n152\t\n153\t| Condition | Total | Unique | Duplication rate | Cause |\n154\t|-----------|-------|--------|------------------|-------|\n155\t| exception_only_train | 4720 | 2858 | 39.45% | 同题多个 passing 解映射为相同 (input, output) — 无异常 → 同一 trace |\n156\t| exception_only_test | 1190 | 607 | 48.99% | 同上 |\n157\t| raw_traces | 5910 | 5803 | 1.81% | 完整 trace 含行号/变量值/内存地址，几乎不重复 |\n158\t\n159\t**Train-test input overlap: 0（无数据泄漏）**\n160\t\n161\t**解读**: exception_only 高重复率是 representation 的自然属性，非数据问题。多个正确解对同一测试用例执行时若均无异常，exception_only 表征退化为相同的空/无异常标记。这恰好说明 exception signal 的 compactness — 它仅编码 fault presence，不编码 solution identity。raw_traces 重复率极低 (1.81%) 因为完整 trace 包含 solution-specific 信息（变量值、内存地址）。尽管高重复率意味着有效训练样本少于名义数量，模型仍达 99.83% — 进一步确认 exception signal 的 learnability。\n162\t\n163\t## DeepSeek full_trace 处理\n164\t\n165\t**现状**: v1 坍塌（28.5%, 100% 预测 fail, 根因: 训练端 label 截断）。v2 重训启动但被 kill（Loop #6 ops worker 腾 GPU 给 vota_seed456）。v3 RUNNING（label-preserving truncation fix）。\n166\t\n167\t**处理方案**: v3 正在 cuda:0 上训练，预计 5/16 完成。\n168\t\n169\t**VOTA vs full_trace 截断机制区分** (D030 token analysis 确认):\n170\t- **full_trace v1**: SFTTrainer right-truncation 切掉了 verdict **label** → 100% predict fail → 坍塌。根因: DeepSeek tokenizer 对 full_trace 产生 >2048 tokens, label 在截断窗口外。\n171\t- **VOTA**: `to_chat_text()` 保留 verdict label（label 完整），但 91.7% 的样本 **trace content（input）被截断**（mean 2626 → ~2048 tokens）。84.45% 是真实结果，反映 trace 信息损失对模型学习的影响，**不是** label corruption。\n172\t- **exception_only**: token 长度远低于 2048，不受截断影响，跨模型对比 clean。\n173\t\n174\t**对论文叙事的影响**: 论文中所有 \"right-truncation corrupts/removes the verdict label\" 措辞**对 VOTA 不成立**——label 完整保留，被截断的是 trace input。正确表述: \"trace content truncation causes information loss\"。VOTA cross-model gap (14.96pp) 有两个贡献因素: (1) model capability, (2) training-time trace truncation on DeepSeek (see D11)。\n175\t\n176\t## External Benchmark (DebugBench) Positioning\n177\t\n178\t**DebugBench 仅作泛化性验证，不作 trace importance 证据。**\n179\t\n180\t| Condition | Main Dataset | DebugBench | Δ interpretation |\n181\t|-----------|-------------|------------|------------------|\n182\t| no_trace | 75.13% | 96.71% | DebugBench 天花板高，baseline 已强 |\n183\t| VOTA | 99.41% | 99.77% | +3.06pp lift — 边际 |\n184\t| exception_only | 99.83% | 100.00% | +3.29pp lift — 边际 |\n185\t\n186\t**主数据集 trace lift = 24.70pp**（no_trace → exception_only），DebugBench trace lift 不到其 1/7。\n187\t\n188\t**论文定位规则**：\n189\t- DebugBench → 泛化性证据（exception_only 100% = 跨数据集鲁棒性）\n190\t- Trace importance 论证 → 仅依赖主数据集（24.7pp lift）\n191\t- 禁止用 DebugBench 的 3.29pp lift 论证 \"trace 的核心价值\"——审稿人会攻击天花板效应\n192\t\n193\t## Venue Fit Risks\n194\t\n195\t| Risk | Assessment | Mitigation |\n196\t|------|-----------|------------|\n197\t| 单任务 | 仍然只在 test verdict prediction 上验证 | 跨模型验证部分弥补; Discussion 中讨论 generalization |\n198\t| 单数据集 | HumanEval + MBPP-sanitized 是唯一数据源 (591 problems × 10 solutions) | 定位为 empirical study, 深度优于广度; 两个标准 benchmark 组合覆盖多样编程题型; exception_only 有效训练样本仅 2858 unique 即达 99.83%, 暗示 signal 的 simplicity 降低对数据量的依赖 |\n199\t| \"只是 feature engineering\" | exception extraction 不复杂 | simplicity 本身是 contribution — 最简信号最 robust |\n200\t| Negative result 味道 | VOTA 跨模型不 robust | Reframe: 识别 robust vs non-robust 组件边界是 positive |\n201\t| Seed robustness (Qwen) | ✅ 已解决: 99.83% ± 0.00 (3 seeds), irreducible samples 确认 | — |\n202\t| Seed robustness (DeepSeek) | ✅ 3-seed 完整: 2/3 at 99.33%, 1 at 91.09% | LoRA initialization sensitivity — median robust, worst still > all alternatives; 转化为 training stability finding (D9/D10) |\n203\t| Calibration | ✅ 完整数据: Tier 1 ECE≤0.003, no_trace ECE=0.171 (~63x gap) | Brier ~150x gap 进一步确认 |\n204\t| 只用 2 个模型 | 有限但有意义的 diversity | Architecture + pretraining data (5.5T vs 2T) + CRUXEval gap (17.5pp) 构成充分差异 |\n205\t| 数据重复率 | exception_only 训练集 39.45% 重复 | 非数据泄漏（train-test overlap = 0）；是 representation compactness 的自然结果；有效样本仍足够学习 |\n206\t\n207\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n208\t\n209\t| Concern | Planned Response |\n210\t|---------|-----------------|\n211\t| \"exception_only 99.83% 是不是 trivial pattern matching [ERROR] 有无？\" | full_trace 也包含 [ERROR] 但仅 81.76%——模型需要从 trace context 中 extract 和 utilize exception signal, 不是简单 keyword detection. no_trace 无 exception, 75.13%. |\n212\t| \"为什么 exception_only > VOTA? adding info 反而降?\" | 非 exception 组件 (loop/ae tokens) 稀释 attention 对 exception 信号的聚焦. Calibration: exception_only ECE=0.0027 vs VOTA ECE=0.0054. 部分样本 loop 正常但有 exception, 引入矛盾信号. |\n213\t| \"CRUXEval gap 与 VOTA gap 的相关性可能是 coincidence\" | 明确标注为 hypothesis. 列出 alternatives (tokenizer efficiency, pretraining scale 2.75x, chat template). 不 overclaim. |\n214\t| \"只有 2 个模型，universality claim 太强\" | 同意是 limitation. 两模型在 architecture (RoPE vs ALiBi), pretraining data (5.5T vs 2T), execution reasoning (CRUXEval 17.5pp gap) 上有充分差异, 不是 trivial replication. Exception signal 的 structural simplicity 提供 inductive argument for broader generalization. |\n215\t| \"99.83% 可能 saturated, 看不出 exception 到底学了什么\" | Calibration 双指标: exception_only ECE=0.0027, Brier=0.0013 (近完美校准). 对比 no_trace ECE=0.1715, Brier=0.1972 (~63x/~150x gap). **Irreducible error 根因已明确**: 2/1190 errors 均因 Python `all()` 短路触发 `GeneratorExit`（`BaseException` 子类，非真正错误），tracer 将其标记为 `[ERROR]`。模型看到 7 行 `[ERROR] GeneratorExit` 合理预测 fail，但代码实际正确。整个测试集仅这 2 条含 `GeneratorExit`，无训练信号可学习其良性本质。99.83% 是 representation 的理论上限，非 saturation artifact。 |\n216\t| \"只用了 1 个 seed\" | Qwen ✅: 3 seeds 99.83% ± 0.00. DeepSeek ✅: 3 seeds 完整 — seed42/456=99.33%, seed123=91.09%。2/3 鲁棒，1 离群。median=99.33%, worst=91.09% (仍 > VOTA 84.45%)。论文透明报告所有 seeds，将 seed sensitivity 转化为 LoRA training stability 的 finding（D9）。 |\n217\t| \"eval_loss 上升但 accuracy 提升——checkpoint selection 有问题?\" | Discussion D1: token-level loss 与 binary verdict accuracy 解耦. 推荐 verdict-specific metric. Methodological contribution. |\n218\t| \"DeepSeek full_trace 坍塌是 bug 不是 finding\" | 诚实披露根因 (训练端 label 截断). 其他 3 条件不受影响. 修复版本如就绪则补入. |\n219\t| \"calibration 数据只有 1 个 seed\" | Seed robustness 已证明 accuracy variance=0 (3 seeds), calibration 在 accuracy 完全一致的前提下 expected 也一致. ECE/Brier 的极小值 (0.0027/0.0013) 留有极小 variance 空间. |\n220\t| \"DeepSeek epoch1 > epoch3, 为什么用 epoch3 报告?\" | 正文报告所有 seeds 的 final + best checkpoint。seed42: epoch1=99.83%, epoch3=99.33%。seed123: epoch1=91.43%, epoch3=91.09%。D7 讨论 early stopping + D9 讨论 LoRA initialization sensitivity。不 cherry-pick best seed。 |\n221\t| \"DeepSeek seed sensitivity 说明 exception signal 不 robust\" | Exception_only 在所有 seeds 上仍优于其他条件（worst seed 91.09% > VOTA 84.45%）。Seed sensitivity 是 LoRA training 问题而非 signal 问题——Qwen 3 seeds 完美证明 signal 本身 robust。D9 讨论 training stabilization 作为 practical recommendation。 |\n222\t| \"exception_only 数据集 ~40-49% 重复，有效训练样本不足？\" | 重复源自 representation compactness：同题多个 passing 解均无异常 → 相同 trace。**非数据泄漏**（train-test input overlap = 0）。raw_traces 仅 1.81% 重复，确认重复是 exception_only 表征特性而非数据收集问题。模型在有效样本仅 2858 unique 的条件下仍达 99.83%，反而说明 exception signal 的高 learnability — 少量 unique 样本即可充分学习 fault detection pattern。 |\n223\t\n224\t## Discussion 要点\n225\t\n226\t### D1: eval_loss vs verdict accuracy 解耦\n227\tDeepSeek VOTA: eval_loss epoch1→3 从 0.068 升至 0.112 (+65%), 但 accuracy 从 78.15% 升至 84.45% (+6.3pp). Token-level calibration 与 binary classification accuracy 方向相反. **Implication**: verdict tasks 应用 task-specific metric (accuracy/F1) 做 checkpoint selection, 非 eval_loss.\n228\t\n229\t### D2: CRUXEval gap 假说 (revised — D030 confound)\n230\tVOTA 跨模型 gap (14.96pp) 与 CRUXEval execution reasoning gap (15-17.5pp) 数值吻合. 假说: trace utilization effectiveness 受 base model \"execution reasoning readiness\" 约束. **标注**: hypothesis, N=2, 列出 alternatives. 不 overclaim. **注意**: 我们的训练/测试数据来自 HumanEval + MBPP-sanitized（非 CRUXEval），CRUXEval-I 分数仅作为衡量两个模型 execution reasoning 能力差异的外部参照。论文中必须明确区分数据来源与外部基准引用。**D030/D034 truncation evidence**: 14.96pp gap 中截断效应有因果证据: group_analysis 显示 train-truncated 83.04% vs train-intact 100% (Fisher p≈0, 推理时无截断)。截断因果方向可 claim，模型能力差异是 residual confound。CRUXEval gap 数值吻合可能部分巧合。论文中截断效应应作为 established factor 讨论（有 group_analysis 因果证据），模型能力假说标注为 residual confound hypothesis。\n231\t\n232\t### D3: Simplicity as robustness (revised)\n233\tException signal 在两模型上均为最优组件，其结构简单性确保了相对优势的跨模型 robustness。但 DeepSeek seed sensitivity 揭示：simplicity 确保 signal 本身 robust，但 LoRA 训练过程是否稳定收敛到正确映射取决于模型。**trace design 应匹配 deployment model 的能力下界**，且需关注 training stability（建议：多 seed 验证 + 考虑 training stabilization 技巧如 warmup、learning rate schedule）。\n234\t\n235\t### D4: Checkpoint selection 与 gap 报告 (revised)\n236\t正文报告所有 seeds 的 final checkpoint 结果 + best checkpoint 结果，不 cherry-pick。DeepSeek seed42: epoch1=99.83%, epoch3=99.33%（退化 0.50pp）。DeepSeek seed123: epoch1=91.43%, epoch3=91.09%（退化 0.34pp）。两个 seed 均显示轻微 epoch 退化，但核心差异在 epoch1 起点（8.40pp gap），不是训练过程。\n237\t\n238\t### D5: Irreducible samples — GeneratorExit 根因分析\n239\t3 seeds 的 2/1190 errors 完全相同（id=901, 905, 均来自 HumanEval/95 `check_dict_case`），方向一致（pass→fail false negatives）。\n240\t\n241\t**根因**: Python `all()` 对 generator expression 短路时丢弃未耗尽的 generator，触发 `GeneratorExit`。`GeneratorExit` 继承自 `BaseException`（非 `Exception`），是 Python 内部控制流机制而非真正错误。但 tracer 对所有 caught exceptions 统一标记 `[ERROR]`，导致 exception_only 模型看到 7 行 `[ERROR] GeneratorExit`，合理但错误地预测 fail。\n242\t\n243\t**为何不可约**:\n244\t1. **表征局限**: exception_only 条件下模型仅见异常数据，无法访问控制流、返回值或 assertion 结果。`GeneratorExit` 在此表征中与真正错误不可区分。\n245\t2. **跨 seed 确定性**: 3 个 random seeds 产生完全相同的 errors，确认这是 data/representation 属性而非模型初始化随机性。\n246\t3. **训练集无信号**: 整个 1190 条测试集仅这 2 条含 `GeneratorExit`，训练集中也缺乏足够的 `GeneratorExit` 良性样本供模型学习。\n247\t4. **人类也会犯错**: 仅看 exception trace（7 行 `[ERROR]`），人类审查者在不了解 Python generator protocol 的情况下也会预测 fail。\n248\t\n249\t**对论文的意义**: (1) 99.83% 是 exception_only representation 在此数据集上的理论 ceiling，非 saturation artifact；(2) 揭示 tracer 设计的改进方向——区分 `BaseException` 子类（如 `GeneratorExit`, `KeyboardInterrupt`）与 `Exception` 子类（真正的程序错误）可消除此类 irreducible error；(3) 提供 concrete evidence 说明 exception_only 模型\"理解\"的是 `[ERROR]` tag 的 fault indicator 语义，而非 exception type 的 fine-grained 含义。\n250\t\n251\t### D6: Calibration as secondary evidence\n252\tCalibration 数据提供独立于 accuracy 的 evidence dimension。no_trace Brier=0.1972 说明模型无 trace 时不仅预测错，且对错误预测过度自信。exception_only Brier=0.0013 说明模型在有 exception signal 时几乎完美区分确定性和不确定性。这支持 Claim 1 的 \"sufficient signal\" 论点——exception 不仅让模型预测对，还让模型 \"知道自己对\"。\n253\t\n254\t### D7: Early stopping for exception signal (revised — D030 epoch1 data complete)\n255\t3-seed epoch1 完整数据：seed42 epoch1=99.83% → epoch3=99.33%（-0.50pp）；**seed456 epoch1=99.33% → epoch3=99.33%（0.00pp）**；seed123 epoch1=91.43% → epoch3=91.09%（-0.34pp）。**seed42 的 epoch1=99.83%（匹配 Qwen）是该 seed 独有的 LoRA 初始化运气，不是 DeepSeek epoch1 的通用属性。** seed456 epoch1=epoch3 说明 epoch 退化非普遍现象。核心差异仍是 LoRA 初始化（epoch1 起点差 8.40pp），不是 overfitting。Early stopping 无法挽救差的初始化（seed123）。**Implication**: (1) 报告 DeepSeek 结果时应使用 median/2-of-3 (99.33%)，不应以 seed42 epoch1=99.83% 作为 headline；(2) epoch1 peak 是 LoRA 初始化运气的副产物，不具推广性。对比: VOTA 在 DeepSeek 上 84.45% **已确认正确**（D030 关闭: confirmatory re-eval max_length=16384 → 84.45%，与原始训练评估精确一致；D030 根因是 evaluate.py v2 的 max_length=2048 eval-time 截断 bug 导致 82.6% 预测为 garbage tokens）。\n256\t\n257\t### D9: LoRA initialization sensitivity as secondary bottleneck [NEW — D028]\n258\tDeepSeek exception_only seed42=99.83% vs seed123=91.43% (epoch1), 8.40pp gap。Qwen 3 seeds 完全一致。假说：exception signal 的 learnability 取决于 (1) signal 本身的结构简单性（cross-model robust）+ (2) LoRA 初始化是否落入能正确映射 exception→verdict 的 basin。Qwen-7B 可能因模型更强/LoRA landscape 更平滑而对初始化不敏感。DeepSeek-6.7B（CRUXEval-I 39% vs Qwen 56.5%）的 loss landscape 可能更 rugged，LoRA 初始化更易陷入 suboptimal basin（seed123 的 fail_recall 仅 70-72% 说明模型未学到 exception→fail 映射的关键部分）。**论文角度**: 这不是 negative result——它揭示了 trace SFT 的 practical consideration（training stability），可作为 contribution 的一部分。建议 Discussion 讨论 training stabilization 策略（warmup, lr schedule, LoRA rank 调整, multi-seed selection）。\n259\t\n260\t### D10: Train loss ≈ but accuracy ≠ across seeds [NEW — D029]\n261\tDeepSeek exception_only seed456 (train_loss=0.1225) 与 seed123 (train_loss=0.122) 训练损失几乎相同，但 accuracy 差 8.2pp（99.33% vs 91.09%）。关键差异集中在 fail_recall（1.0 vs 0.705）——token-level loss 在所有 tokens 上平均，掩盖了 fail 类少数样本的 sample-level 分类能力差异。**Implication**: (1) 扩展 D1 (eval_loss vs accuracy decoupling) 到训练阶段：train_loss 同样不是 verdict task accuracy 的可靠代理指标；(2) 对 checkpoint selection 的实际建议更强：必须用 task-specific metric (accuracy/F1)，甚至 train_loss 收敛也不保证 task performance；(3) fail 类作为少数类（28.5%），其学习质量被平均 loss 稀释——这在 class-imbalanced 设置下是 general pattern，可推广到其他 verdict/detection 任务。\n262\t\n263\t### D11: VOTA cross-model gap: training-time trace truncation as causal factor [NEW — D030 token analysis + group_analysis]\n264\tD030 token analysis 确认: `to_chat_text()` 保留 labels（verdict label 在训练时未被截断），但 91.7% 的 DeepSeek VOTA 训练样本的 **trace content** 从 mean 2626 tokens 被截断到 ~2048 tokens。\n265\t\n266\t**Group analysis 提供因果证据**: 将测试集按训练截断状态分组（推理时无截断, max_length=16384），train-truncated 组 accuracy=83.04% vs train-intact 组 accuracy=100%, Fisher exact p≈0。**截断的因果方向可以 claim**: 训练时 trace 被截断导致模型学到的信息不完整 → 推理时即使看到完整 trace 也无法正确判断。模型能力差异是残余 confound（无法完全分离）。\n267\t\n268\t**Implications**: (1) 论文中所有 \"right-truncation corrupts/removes the verdict label\" 措辞对 VOTA 不成立——label 完整保留，被截断的是 trace INPUT content；(2) 14.96pp gap 中截断效应有因果证据（group_analysis），模型能力差异是 residual confound；(3) exception_only 因 token 长度短（远低于 2048）不受截断影响，其跨模型对比更 clean——进一步强化 Claim 1 \"most robust component\" 叙事；(4) 论文应讨论 max_length 的影响作为 limitation/future work；(5) group_analysis 数据可作为 Table/Figure 纳入论文——展示截断的因果效应。\n269\t\n270\t### D8: Data duplication as representation signature\n271\texception_only 训练集 39.45% 重复（4720→2858 unique），测试集 48.99%（1190→607 unique），而 raw_traces 仅 1.81%（5910→5803 unique）。重复源自 exception_only 表征的 design-by-intent compactness：同一编程题的多个 passing 解执行时均无异常，exception_only 表征退化为相同的空标记。这一数据特征本身就是 Claim 3 two-tier hierarchy 的佐证——Tier 1 信号仅编码 fault presence/absence，不编码 solution-level details，因此天然高重复。Train-test input overlap = 0 排除数据泄漏。\n272\t\n273\t## Contingency Framing (已解决, 留存档)\n274\t\n275\t### Claim 1 — RESOLVED (D029: seed456=99.33% confirms \"consistently best component\")\n276\tseed456 与 seed42 完全一致（均 99.33%），seed123 为孤立离群值。Claim 1 定稿为 \"exception events consistently best component across models; absolute performance seed-dependent on DeepSeek (2/3 seeds robust, 1 outlier from LoRA init sensitivity); relative dominance over all alternatives robust across all seeds\"。\"0pp universal gap\" 叙事已放弃，转为数据驱动的 nuanced framing。\n277\t\n278\t### Claim 2 — RESOLVED (D006 + D009)\n279\tv5 full_trace 81.76%. plan_002 label-only 86.22%, gradient dilution = minor (26%). 跨模型 VOTA gap 补充证据.\n280\t\n281\t## 与 v1 Framing 的关键差异\n282\t\n283\t| 维度 | v1 | v2.9 |\n284\t|------|----|----|\n285\t| Headline | VOTA compression 优于 full trace | Exception events are the most effective diagnostic signal |\n286\t| Primary claim | VOTA +24pp through fault indicator preservation | Exception signal consistently best across models; absolute performance seed-dependent on DeepSeek |\n287\t| Claim 2 | Compression > full trace (只有 gradient dilution) | Information density primary + gradient dilution quantification + cross-model reinforcement |\n288\t| Claim 3 Tier 1 | exception_only only | exception + assertion-point (co-Tier 1, D020) |\n289\t| VOTA 定位 | 核心方法 — trace compression | **Fault indicator isolation** — 价值在于提取 exception, 非 generic compression |\n290\t| Model scope | 单模型 (Qwen) | 双模型, 跨模型对比是核心贡献 |\n291\t| DeepSeek full_trace | N/A | v1 collapsed (label truncation), v3 pending |\n292\t| Seed robustness | 未验证 | Qwen ✅ 99.83% ± 0.00 (3 seeds); DeepSeek ⚠️ seed-dependent (91-99%, D028) |\n293\t| Irreducible error | 未分析 | ✅ GeneratorExit 根因明确，99.83% = representation ceiling |\n294\t| Calibration | 未验证 | ✅ 完整 ECE+Brier, ~63x/~150x gap vs no_trace |\n295\t| Data duplication | 未分析 | ✅ exception_only ~40% 重复（representation compactness），train-test overlap = 0 |\n296\t| Early stopping | 未讨论 | DeepSeek epoch1→epoch3 轻微退化 (0.3-0.5pp); 核心问题是 LoRA 初始化 (seed123 epoch1=91.43%), 非 overfitting |\n297\t| Narrative arc | \"VOTA helps\" | \"Exception events are consistently best; VOTA's value is isolating them; training stability matters\" |\n298\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"01f816b3-f92f-4f34-a12d-93882a8a178e","uuid":"c34b3598-c891-4fe0-bb0d-6771309763ec","timestamp":"2026-05-18T12:08:07.922Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_4/projects/trace-verdict-study/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260518T113804/best/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — trace-verdict-study\n\n> v3.0 — [UPDATED 2026-05-15] D030 CLOSED: DeepSeek VOTA 84.45% confirmed correct (confirmatory re-eval). **Critical narrative fix**: to_chat_text() preserves labels → VOTA 训练时 verdict label 未被截断 → 论文中 \"label truncation/corruption\" 措辞对 VOTA 不成立。正确叙事: trace INPUT content 被截断 (91.7% samples), 84.45% 反映 trace information loss。新增 D11: VOTA cross-model gap confounded by training-time truncation。数据集来源：HumanEval (164) + MBPP-sanitized (427) = 591 problems × 10 LLM-generated solutions = 5910 samples。\n\n## Target Venue\n- Primary: EMNLP 2026 Main (ARR submission)\n- Fallback: EMNLP 2026 Findings\n- Deadline: ARR May 25, 2026\n\n## Core Insight\n\nVerdict prediction (pass/fail) is fundamentally a **fault detection** task. The most effective signal is the **exception event** — a compact, structured diagnostic moment that consistently outperforms all other trace representations across models (Qwen 99.83% ± 0.00 across 3 seeds; DeepSeek 91-99% depending on seed, but always > VOTA 84.45% and no_trace 73.36%). In contrast, richer trace representations that require deeper execution reasoning show model-dependent effectiveness: VOTA gap = 14.96pp, no_trace gap = 1.77pp. Information density — not training signal distribution — is the primary bottleneck: even oracle loss masking (label-only) cannot close the 13pp gap between full traces and targeted extraction. The design principle: **extract the highest-specificity diagnostic signal; discard everything else.** Cross-model absolute performance depends on LoRA initialization stability, but exception_only's relative dominance over other components is robust.\n\nVOTA's primary contribution is **fault indicator isolation** — automatically extracting exception events from noisy full traces — rather than generic trace compression. The \"compression helps\" narrative was a stepping stone; the real mechanism is diagnostic signal extraction.\n\n## Core Claims (3)\n\n### Claim 1: Exception events are the most effective trace component for verdict prediction\n\nException summaries consistently achieve the highest verdict prediction accuracy across both models tested, outperforming all other trace representations in every seed. On Qwen-2.5-Coder-7B, performance is perfectly robust: 99.83% ± 0.00 (3 seeds). On DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B, absolute accuracy is seed-dependent (seed42=99.83% epoch1, seed123=91.43% epoch1; Δ=8.40pp), consistent with LoRA initialization sensitivity — but exception_only still dominates VOTA (84.45%) and no_trace (73.36%) in all seeds. This contrasts with VOTA (cross-model gap = 14.96pp) and no_trace (gap = 1.77pp). Exception events are structurally simple (`[ERROR] type: ... message: ...`) and do not require deep trace reasoning.\n\n**Supporting evidence:**\n- `vota_exception_only_seed42_v2`: Qwen 99.83%, ECE=0.0027\n- `deepseek_exception_only_seed42`: DeepSeek 99.83% (epoch1) / 99.33% (epoch3)\n- `deepseek_exception_only_seed456`: DeepSeek 99.33% (epoch3), CI [98.82, 99.75] — 与 seed42 完全一致\n- `deepseek_exception_only_seed123`: DeepSeek 91.43% (epoch1) / 91.09% (epoch3) — LoRA init sensitivity outlier\n- `deepseek_vota_seed42`: DeepSeek VOTA 84.45% (gap = 14.96pp vs Qwen)\n- `deepseek_no_trace_seed42`: DeepSeek no_trace 73.36% (gap = 1.77pp vs Qwen)\n- `vota_no_ae_seed42`: 99.41% — actual/expected removal 不降，非 trivial string comparison\n\n**DeepSeek seed analysis** ✅ (FINALIZED, D029):\n\n| Seed | Epoch 3 (final) | fail_recall | pass_recall | train_loss | Errors | CI |\n|------|-----------------|-------------|-------------|------------|--------|-----|\n| 42   | 99.33%          | 1.0         | 0.9906      | —          | 8/1190 | — |\n| 456  | 99.33%          | 1.0         | 0.9906      | 0.1225     | 8/1190 | [98.82, 99.75] |\n| 123  | 91.09%          | 0.705       | 0.993       | 0.122      | —      | [89.4, 92.6] |\n\nseed42 与 seed456 结果**完全一致**（均 8/1190 错误，99.33%），seed123 为离群值。seed123 的 fail_recall 仅 0.705 — LoRA 初始化落入差的局部最优，未充分学到 exception→fail 映射。**关键发现**: seed456 和 seed123 的 train_loss 几乎相同（0.1225 vs 0.122），但 accuracy 差 8.2pp — token-level loss 掩盖了 sample-level 分类能力的巨大差异（详见 D10）。\n\n**Irreducible error analysis** ✅: 3 seeds 错误的 2 个样本 (id=901, 905) 均来自 HumanEval/95 (`check_dict_case`)，根因为 Python `all()` 对 generator expression 短路触发 `GeneratorExit`（`BaseException` 子类，非真正错误）。tracer 将其标记为 `[ERROR]`，exception_only 模型看到 7 行 `[ERROR] GeneratorExit`，合理但错误地预测 fail。整个 1190 条测试集仅这 2 条含 `GeneratorExit`，模型无训练信号学习其良性本质。**这确认 99.83% 是 exception_only 表征的理论上限，剩余 0.17% 是 representation-inherent irreducible error，而非模型不足。**\n\n**Seed robustness** ✅: Qwen exception_only 3-seed 完全一致，构成本文最强 robustness 证据：\n\n| Seed | Accuracy | 95% CI | Errors |\n|------|----------|--------|--------|\n| 42 | 99.83% | [99.58, 100] | 2/1190 |\n| 123 | 99.83% | [99.58, 100] | 2/1190 |\n| 456 | 99.83% | [99.58, 100] | 2/1190 |\n\n3 seeds 错误样本 100% 重叠（id=901, 905, 均为 `check_dict_case` 函数, label=pass → pred=fail）。**Irreducible samples**: 模型已达数据集理论上限，variance = 0。\n\n**DeepSeek cross-model** ✅ (D029): 3-seed 完整数据 — seed42/456=99.33%, seed123=91.09%。2/3 seeds 鲁棒，seed123 为 LoRA 初始化离群值（fail_recall 仅 0.705）。Qwen 3-seed 完美稳定 (99.83% ± 0.00) vs DeepSeek 高方差（σ≈4.8pp），暗示 exception signal 的 learnability 与模型 LoRA 训练稳定性相关。但即使最差 seed (91.09%) 仍优于 VOTA (84.45%) 和 no_trace (73.36%)，relative dominance robust。\n\n### Claim 2: Information density, not gradient dilution, drives trace compression benefit\n\nFull traces help verdict prediction (81.76% [`full_trace_seed42_v5`], +6.6pp over baseline), but VOTA achieves 99.41% [`vota_seed42_v5`] (+24.3pp) — a +17.6pp advantage. Label-only loss ablation (plan_002) quantifies the causal decomposition: **gradient dilution contributes ~26% of the gap** (4.5pp; label-only full_trace = 86.22% [`full_trace_label_only_seed42`]), **information overload contributes ~74%** (13.0pp; only trace compression resolves this). Even with oracle loss masking that eliminates gradient dilution, full traces still underperform VOTA by 13pp.\n\nCross-model evidence reinforces this: VOTA gap (14.96pp) partly tracks base model execution reasoning capability (Qwen CRUXEval-I 56.5% vs DeepSeek 39.0%, Δ=17.5pp), though **confounded by DeepSeek training-time trace truncation** (91.7% of VOTA samples truncated to ~2048 tokens; see D11). The two factors cannot be disentangled in the current design. Exception signal partially bypasses both bottlenecks (token-short, no truncation; consistently best component on both models), though DeepSeek shows seed-dependent absolute performance (91-99%).\n\n**Supporting evidence:**\n- `full_trace_label_only_seed42`: 86.22%, ECE=0.1107 (gradient dilution fix, +4.5pp over standard full_trace)\n- `full_trace_seed42_v5`: 81.76%, ECE=0.0958 (standard full_trace)\n- `vota_seed42_v5`: 99.41%, ECE=0.0054\n- `deepseek_vota_seed42`: 84.45% (VOTA model-dependent)\n- CRUXEval literature data (Wang et al.)\n\n### Claim 3: Two-tier diagnostic hierarchy for verdict prediction\n\nComponent ablation reveals verdict-relevant trace information has a strict two-tier hierarchy:\n- **Tier 1 — diagnostic moment signals**: exception summaries (99.83% [`vota_exception_only_seed42_v2`]) and assertion-point information (99.92% [`vota_ae_only_seed42`]) are individually near-perfect and sufficient for verdict prediction on Qwen. These signals are structurally simple and consistently the most effective component on both models, though DeepSeek absolute performance is seed-dependent.\n- **Tier 2 — behavioral patterns**: loop compression (85.63% [`vota_loop_only_seed42`]) carries substantial signal but is model-dependent and fully subsumed by Tier 1.\n\nCombining tiers introduces noise rather than helping: exception_only (99.83%) > VOTA full (99.41%), p=0.01. Loop_only ≈ full_trace_label_only (85.63% vs 86.22%) confirms VOTA's loop compression precisely extracts the useful behavioral signal from full traces.\n\n**Supporting evidence:**\n- `vota_exception_only_seed42_v2`: 99.83%, ECE=0.0027 (Tier 1 exception)\n- `vota_ae_only_seed42`: 99.92%, ECE=0.0004 (Tier 1 assertion-point, 与 exception 统计等价 p=0.80)\n- `vota_loop_only_seed42`: 85.63%, ECE=0.0831 (Tier 2 behavioral)\n- `full_trace_label_only_seed42`: 86.22%, ECE=0.1107 (≈ loop_only, confirming extraction equivalence)\n- `deepseek_exception_only_seed42`: 99.83% epoch1 / 99.33% epoch3 (Tier 1 cross-model validation)\n- `deepseek_vota_seed42`: 84.45% (Tier 1+2 cross-model: Tier 2 introduces model-dependent degradation)\n\n**Calibration**: 完整 calibration 数据确认 Tier 1 信号不仅 accuracy 近完美，置信度校准也近完美：\n\n| Condition | Accuracy | ECE | Brier | 解读 |\n|-----------|----------|-----|-------|------|\n| ae_only | 99.92% | 0.0004 | 0.0008 | 近乎完美校准 |\n| exception_only | 99.83% | 0.0027 | 0.0013 | 近乎完美校准 |\n| VOTA | 99.41% | 0.0054 | 0.005 | 优秀，但 Tier 2 引入轻微 noise |\n| loop_only | 85.63% | 0.0831 | — | Tier 2 单独校准中等 |\n| label_only | 86.22% | 0.1107 | — | gradient dilution fix 仍 miscalibrated |\n| full_trace | 81.76% | 0.0958 | — | 中度 miscalibrated |\n| no_trace | 75.13% | 0.1715 | 0.1972 | 严重 miscalibrated |\n\nno_trace ECE 是 exception_only 的 **~63x**（0.1715/0.0027），Brier 是 **~150x**（0.1972/0.0013）。Trace signal（尤其 Tier 1）不仅提升 accuracy，更从根本上改善模型 calibration。\n\n**Design principle**: verdict-optimized traces should extract highest-specificity diagnostic signals; lower-specificity signals are redundant and may introduce noise.\n\n## Cross-Model Evidence Summary\n\n| Condition | Qwen-2.5-Coder-7B | DeepSeek-Coder-6.7B | Cross-model gap | Interpretation |\n|-----------|-------------------|---------------------|-----------------|----------------|\n| exception_only | 99.83% ± 0.00 (3 seeds) | seed42/456: 99.33%; seed123: 91.09% | 0.50-8.74pp (seed-dependent) | **Best component on both models**; 2/3 DeepSeek seeds match Qwen-level; 1 outlier still > VOTA |\n| VOTA | 99.41% | 84.45% | -14.96pp | Model-dependent — requires execution reasoning; **also confounded by DeepSeek training-time trace truncation** (91.7% of VOTA samples truncated from mean 2626 to ~2048 tokens; labels preserved via to_chat_text(), see D11) |\n| no_trace | 75.13% | 73.36% | -1.77pp | Baseline gap tracks general capability |\n| full_trace | 81.76% | collapsed (v3 pending) | N/A | DeepSeek v1 label truncation bug |\n\n**Key insight**: Exception_only is consistently the best component on both models (even worst DeepSeek seed 91.09% > VOTA 84.45%). Cross-model gap 与 signal complexity 正相关, but exception signal's absolute effectiveness also depends on LoRA training stability. Qwen: perfectly robust (3 seeds identical). DeepSeek: 2/3 seeds at 99.33% (matching Qwen-level), 1 outlier at 91.09% (LoRA initialization). Median performance robust; seed sensitivity suggests smaller/weaker models may need training stabilization (multi-seed selection, warmup tuning) for optimal exception signal utilization.\n\n## VOTA Repositioning\n\n**旧叙事**: VOTA 是 trace compression 方法，价值在于\"压缩使 trace 更有效\"。\n\n**新叙事**: VOTA 是 **fault indicator isolation** 方法，核心价值在于自动从 noisy execution traces 中提取 exception events 等 diagnostic signals。\n\n**证据链**:\n1. exception_only (99.83%) ≥ VOTA full (99.41%) — 压缩后的其他组件（loop, ae）不仅无益，反而引入 noise\n2. VOTA 跨模型 gap = 14.96pp — 因为 VOTA 包含 model-dependent 的 Tier 2 组件（loop compression 需要 execution reasoning）\n3. exception_only 在两个模型上均为最优组件 — isolate 出 Tier 1 后，相对优势 robust（虽然 DeepSeek 绝对值 seed-dependent）\n4. vota_no_ae (99.41%) = VOTA (99.41%) — actual/expected 移除无影响，exception 是真正的 active ingredient\n\n**论文中的表述**: \"VOTA's trace compression pipeline incidentally isolates exception events — the minimal sufficient diagnostic signal. Its value lies not in making traces shorter, but in separating high-specificity fault indicators from low-specificity behavioral patterns.\"\n\n**对 Method section 的影响**: VOTA 仍然完整描述（loop compression + exception + actual/expected），但 Results/Discussion 明确指出 exception isolation 是核心机制，其他组件是 model-capability-dependent bonus。\n\n## Story Spine\n\n- **Problem**: Existing trace SFT studies (DCSH, TracePile) evaluate only generative tasks and find limited, model-dependent benefit. No prior work has tested trace SFT on verdict tasks (binary pass/fail), nor identified what trace components drive classification performance.\n\n- **Existing approaches & gaps**: DCSH (EMNLP Findings 2025) tested 5 trace formats on generation tasks, finding that \"no single trace representation consistently outperforms others.\" TracePile (NeurIPS 2025) scaled to 2.6M samples but only evaluated generation. TRACED (ICSE 2024) showed traces help encoder-based classification. All existing trace formats are designed for execution simulation, not fault detection.\n\n- **Our framing**: We reframe verdict prediction as **fault detection** and ask: what is the minimal sufficient diagnostic signal? Through systematic component ablation across two architecturally distinct models, we discover that exception events — compact, structured error summaries — are consistently the most effective trace component, achieving near-perfect accuracy on Qwen (99.83% ± 0.00, 3 seeds) and outperforming all alternatives on DeepSeek (91-99% vs VOTA 84.45%). Richer trace representations work only when the base model has sufficient execution reasoning capability, making them unreliable for general deployment.\n\n- **Headline result**: \"Exception events consistently achieve the highest verdict accuracy across models (Qwen 99.83%, DeepSeek 91-99%), outperforming VOTA traces (84.45% on DeepSeek, -14.96pp gap) — demonstrating that fault indicator isolation, not trace reasoning, is the robust mechanism for verdict prediction. DeepSeek seed sensitivity reveals LoRA training stability as a secondary factor for smaller models.\"\n\n## Story Arc\n\n1. **Setup**: Trace SFT for code tasks — promising but inconsistent in prior work (DCSH, TracePile). Unknown whether traces help verdict tasks and what trace design matters.\n\n2. **First result — traces help, compression helps more** (single model): no_trace 75.13% → full_trace 81.76% → VOTA 99.41%. Label-only loss ablation decomposes the gap: 26% gradient dilution, 74% information overload. Compression improves accuracy through higher information density, not just cost savings.\n\n3. **Twist — what component actually drives VOTA?** Component ablation reveals exception_only (99.83%) ≥ full VOTA (99.41%). The \"trace reasoning\" narrative is wrong — verdict prediction is fault detection. Tier 1 (exceptions + assertion-point) subsumes Tier 2 (loops). Actual/expected removal doesn't hurt (99.41%).\n\n4. **Cross-model stress test — consistent dominance, not universal perfection**: Exception_only is the best component on both models (even DeepSeek worst seed 91.09% > VOTA 84.45%), but absolute performance is seed-dependent on DeepSeek (91-99% vs Qwen's perfectly stable 99.83%). VOTA degrades by 14.96pp. The structurally simplest component is the most robust, but LoRA initialization sensitivity introduces variance on weaker models. Qwen seed robustness (3-seed variance = 0) + calibration (ECE=0.0027) 确认 exception signal 在强模型上的 reliability。DeepSeek seed sensitivity 揭示 training stability 作为 secondary bottleneck。\n\n5. **Design principle**: For verdict tasks, identify the highest-specificity diagnostic signal (exception events) and discard everything else. VOTA's value is fault indicator isolation — automatically extracting exceptions from noisy traces — not generic compression. Simpler signals are more robust; complexity tolerance depends on model capability.\n\n## Dataset Characteristics\n\n### Data duplication analysis\n\n| Condition | Total | Unique | Duplication rate | Cause |\n|-----------|-------|--------|------------------|-------|\n| exception_only_train | 4720 | 2858 | 39.45% | 同题多个 passing 解映射为相同 (input, output) — 无异常 → 同一 trace |\n| exception_only_test | 1190 | 607 | 48.99% | 同上 |\n| raw_traces | 5910 | 5803 | 1.81% | 完整 trace 含行号/变量值/内存地址，几乎不重复 |\n\n**Train-test input overlap: 0（无数据泄漏）**\n\n**解读**: exception_only 高重复率是 representation 的自然属性，非数据问题。多个正确解对同一测试用例执行时若均无异常，exception_only 表征退化为相同的空/无异常标记。这恰好说明 exception signal 的 compactness — 它仅编码 fault presence，不编码 solution identity。raw_traces 重复率极低 (1.81%) 因为完整 trace 包含 solution-specific 信息（变量值、内存地址）。尽管高重复率意味着有效训练样本少于名义数量，模型仍达 99.83% — 进一步确认 exception signal 的 learnability。\n\n## DeepSeek full_trace 处理\n\n**现状**: v1 坍塌（28.5%, 100% 预测 fail, 根因: 训练端 label 截断）。v2 重训启动但被 kill（Loop #6 ops worker 腾 GPU 给 vota_seed456）。v3 RUNNING（label-preserving truncation fix）。\n\n**处理方案**: v3 正在 cuda:0 上训练，预计 5/16 完成。\n\n**VOTA vs full_trace 截断机制区分** (D030 token analysis 确认):\n- **full_trace v1**: SFTTrainer right-truncation 切掉了 verdict **label** → 100% predict fail → 坍塌。根因: DeepSeek tokenizer 对 full_trace 产生 >2048 tokens, label 在截断窗口外。\n- **VOTA**: `to_chat_text()` 保留 verdict label（label 完整），但 91.7% 的样本 **trace content（input）被截断**（mean 2626 → ~2048 tokens）。84.45% 是真实结果，反映 trace 信息损失对模型学习的影响，**不是** label corruption。\n- **exception_only**: token 长度远低于 2048，不受截断影响，跨模型对比 clean。\n\n**对论文叙事的影响**: 论文中所有 \"right-truncation corrupts/removes the verdict label\" 措辞**对 VOTA 不成立**——label 完整保留，被截断的是 trace input。正确表述: \"trace content truncation causes information loss\"。VOTA cross-model gap (14.96pp) 有两个贡献因素: (1) model capability, (2) training-time trace truncation on DeepSeek (see D11)。\n\n## External Benchmark (DebugBench) Positioning\n\n**DebugBench 仅作泛化性验证，不作 trace importance 证据。**\n\n| Condition | Main Dataset | DebugBench | Δ interpretation |\n|-----------|-------------|------------|------------------|\n| no_trace | 75.13% | 96.71% | DebugBench 天花板高，baseline 已强 |\n| VOTA | 99.41% | 99.77% | +3.06pp lift — 边际 |\n| exception_only | 99.83% | 100.00% | +3.29pp lift — 边际 |\n\n**主数据集 trace lift = 24.70pp**（no_trace → exception_only），DebugBench trace lift 不到其 1/7。\n\n**论文定位规则**：\n- DebugBench → 泛化性证据（exception_only 100% = 跨数据集鲁棒性）\n- Trace importance 论证 → 仅依赖主数据集（24.7pp lift）\n- 禁止用 DebugBench 的 3.29pp lift 论证 \"trace 的核心价值\"——审稿人会攻击天花板效应\n\n## Venue Fit Risks\n\n| Risk | Assessment | Mitigation |\n|------|-----------|------------|\n| 单任务 | 仍然只在 test verdict prediction 上验证 | 跨模型验证部分弥补; Discussion 中讨论 generalization |\n| 单数据集 | HumanEval + MBPP-sanitized 是唯一数据源 (591 problems × 10 solutions) | 定位为 empirical study, 深度优于广度; 两个标准 benchmark 组合覆盖多样编程题型; exception_only 有效训练样本仅 2858 unique 即达 99.83%, 暗示 signal 的 simplicity 降低对数据量的依赖 |\n| \"只是 feature engineering\" | exception extraction 不复杂 | simplicity 本身是 contribution — 最简信号最 robust |\n| Negative result 味道 | VOTA 跨模型不 robust | Reframe: 识别 robust vs non-robust 组件边界是 positive |\n| Seed robustness (Qwen) | ✅ 已解决: 99.83% ± 0.00 (3 seeds), irreducible samples 确认 | — |\n| Seed robustness (DeepSeek) | ✅ 3-seed 完整: 2/3 at 99.33%, 1 at 91.09% | LoRA initialization sensitivity — median robust, worst still > all alternatives; 转化为 training stability finding (D9/D10) |\n| Calibration | ✅ 完整数据: Tier 1 ECE≤0.003, no_trace ECE=0.171 (~63x gap) | Brier ~150x gap 进一步确认 |\n| 只用 2 个模型 | 有限但有意义的 diversity | Architecture + pretraining data (5.5T vs 2T) + CRUXEval gap (17.5pp) 构成充分差异 |\n| 数据重复率 | exception_only 训练集 39.45% 重复 | 非数据泄漏（train-test overlap = 0）；是 representation compactness 的自然结果；有效样本仍足够学习 |\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n\n| Concern | Planned Response |\n|---------|-----------------|\n| \"exception_only 99.83% 是不是 trivial pattern matching [ERROR] 有无？\" | full_trace 也包含 [ERROR] 但仅 81.76%——模型需要从 trace context 中 extract 和 utilize exception signal, 不是简单 keyword detection. no_trace 无 exception, 75.13%. |\n| \"为什么 exception_only > VOTA? adding info 反而降?\" | 非 exception 组件 (loop/ae tokens) 稀释 attention 对 exception 信号的聚焦. Calibration: exception_only ECE=0.0027 vs VOTA ECE=0.0054. 部分样本 loop 正常但有 exception, 引入矛盾信号. |\n| \"CRUXEval gap 与 VOTA gap 的相关性可能是 coincidence\" | 明确标注为 hypothesis. 列出 alternatives (tokenizer efficiency, pretraining scale 2.75x, chat template). 不 overclaim. |\n| \"只有 2 个模型，universality claim 太强\" | 同意是 limitation. 两模型在 architecture (RoPE vs ALiBi), pretraining data (5.5T vs 2T), execution reasoning (CRUXEval 17.5pp gap) 上有充分差异, 不是 trivial replication. Exception signal 的 structural simplicity 提供 inductive argument for broader generalization. |\n| \"99.83% 可能 saturated, 看不出 exception 到底学了什么\" | Calibration 双指标: exception_only ECE=0.0027, Brier=0.0013 (近完美校准). 对比 no_trace ECE=0.1715, Brier=0.1972 (~63x/~150x gap). **Irreducible error 根因已明确**: 2/1190 errors 均因 Python `all()` 短路触发 `GeneratorExit`（`BaseException` 子类，非真正错误），tracer 将其标记为 `[ERROR]`。模型看到 7 行 `[ERROR] GeneratorExit` 合理预测 fail，但代码实际正确。整个测试集仅这 2 条含 `GeneratorExit`，无训练信号可学习其良性本质。99.83% 是 representation 的理论上限，非 saturation artifact。 |\n| \"只用了 1 个 seed\" | Qwen ✅: 3 seeds 99.83% ± 0.00. DeepSeek ✅: 3 seeds 完整 — seed42/456=99.33%, seed123=91.09%。2/3 鲁棒，1 离群。median=99.33%, worst=91.09% (仍 > VOTA 84.45%)。论文透明报告所有 seeds，将 seed sensitivity 转化为 LoRA training stability 的 finding（D9）。 |\n| \"eval_loss 上升但 accuracy 提升——checkpoint selection 有问题?\" | Discussion D1: token-level loss 与 binary verdict accuracy 解耦. 推荐 verdict-specific metric. Methodological contribution. |\n| \"DeepSeek full_trace 坍塌是 bug 不是 finding\" | 诚实披露根因 (训练端 label 截断). 其他 3 条件不受影响. 修复版本如就绪则补入. |\n| \"calibration 数据只有 1 个 seed\" | Seed robustness 已证明 accuracy variance=0 (3 seeds), calibration 在 accuracy 完全一致的前提下 expected 也一致. ECE/Brier 的极小值 (0.0027/0.0013) 留有极小 variance 空间. |\n| \"DeepSeek epoch1 > epoch3, 为什么用 epoch3 报告?\" | 正文报告所有 seeds 的 final + best checkpoint。seed42: epoch1=99.83%, epoch3=99.33%。seed123: epoch1=91.43%, epoch3=91.09%。D7 讨论 early stopping + D9 讨论 LoRA initialization sensitivity。不 cherry-pick best seed。 |\n| \"DeepSeek seed sensitivity 说明 exception signal 不 robust\" | Exception_only 在所有 seeds 上仍优于其他条件（worst seed 91.09% > VOTA 84.45%）。Seed sensitivity 是 LoRA training 问题而非 signal 问题——Qwen 3 seeds 完美证明 signal 本身 robust。D9 讨论 training stabilization 作为 practical recommendation。 |\n| \"exception_only 数据集 ~40-49% 重复，有效训练样本不足？\" | 重复源自 representation compactness：同题多个 passing 解均无异常 → 相同 trace。**非数据泄漏**（train-test input overlap = 0）。raw_traces 仅 1.81% 重复，确认重复是 exception_only 表征特性而非数据收集问题。模型在有效样本仅 2858 unique 的条件下仍达 99.83%，反而说明 exception signal 的高 learnability — 少量 unique 样本即可充分学习 fault detection pattern。 |\n\n## Discussion 要点\n\n### D1: eval_loss vs verdict accuracy 解耦\nDeepSeek VOTA: eval_loss epoch1→3 从 0.068 升至 0.112 (+65%), 但 accuracy 从 78.15% 升至 84.45% (+6.3pp). Token-level calibration 与 binary classification accuracy 方向相反. **Implication**: verdict tasks 应用 task-specific metric (accuracy/F1) 做 checkpoint selection, 非 eval_loss.\n\n### D2: CRUXEval gap 假说 (revised — D030 confound)\nVOTA 跨模型 gap (14.96pp) 与 CRUXEval execution reasoning gap (15-17.5pp) 数值吻合. 假说: trace utilization effectiveness 受 base model \"execution reasoning readiness\" 约束. **标注**: hypothesis, N=2, 列出 alternatives. 不 overclaim. **注意**: 我们的训练/测试数据来自 HumanEval + MBPP-sanitized（非 CRUXEval），CRUXEval-I 分数仅作为衡量两个模型 execution reasoning 能力差异的外部参照。论文中必须明确区分数据来源与外部基准引用。**D030/D034 truncation evidence**: 14.96pp gap 中截断效应有因果证据: group_analysis 显示 train-truncated 83.04% vs train-intact 100% (Fisher p≈0, 推理时无截断)。截断因果方向可 claim，模型能力差异是 residual confound。CRUXEval gap 数值吻合可能部分巧合。论文中截断效应应作为 established factor 讨论（有 group_analysis 因果证据），模型能力假说标注为 residual confound hypothesis。\n\n### D3: Simplicity as robustness (revised)\nException signal 在两模型上均为最优组件，其结构简单性确保了相对优势的跨模型 robustness。但 DeepSeek seed sensitivity 揭示：simplicity 确保 signal 本身 robust，但 LoRA 训练过程是否稳定收敛到正确映射取决于模型。**trace design 应匹配 deployment model 的能力下界**，且需关注 training stability（建议：多 seed 验证 + 考虑 training stabilization 技巧如 warmup、learning rate schedule）。\n\n### D4: Checkpoint selection 与 gap 报告 (revised)\n正文报告所有 seeds 的 final checkpoint 结果 + best checkpoint 结果，不 cherry-pick。DeepSeek seed42: epoch1=99.83%, epoch3=99.33%（退化 0.50pp）。DeepSeek seed123: epoch1=91.43%, epoch3=91.09%（退化 0.34pp）。两个 seed 均显示轻微 epoch 退化，但核心差异在 epoch1 起点（8.40pp gap），不是训练过程。\n\n### D5: Irreducible samples — GeneratorExit 根因分析\n3 seeds 的 2/1190 errors 完全相同（id=901, 905, 均来自 HumanEval/95 `check_dict_case`），方向一致（pass→fail false negatives）。\n\n**根因**: Python `all()` 对 generator expression 短路时丢弃未耗尽的 generator，触发 `GeneratorExit`。`GeneratorExit` 继承自 `BaseException`（非 `Exception`），是 Python 内部控制流机制而非真正错误。但 tracer 对所有 caught exceptions 统一标记 `[ERROR]`，导致 exception_only 模型看到 7 行 `[ERROR] GeneratorExit`，合理但错误地预测 fail。\n\n**为何不可约**:\n1. **表征局限**: exception_only 条件下模型仅见异常数据，无法访问控制流、返回值或 assertion 结果。`GeneratorExit` 在此表征中与真正错误不可区分。\n2. **跨 seed 确定性**: 3 个 random seeds 产生完全相同的 errors，确认这是 data/representation 属性而非模型初始化随机性。\n3. **训练集无信号**: 整个 1190 条测试集仅这 2 条含 `GeneratorExit`，训练集中也缺乏足够的 `GeneratorExit` 良性样本供模型学习。\n4. **人类也会犯错**: 仅看 exception trace（7 行 `[ERROR]`），人类审查者在不了解 Python generator protocol 的情况下也会预测 fail。\n\n**对论文的意义**: (1) 99.83% 是 exception_only representation 在此数据集上的理论 ceiling，非 saturation artifact；(2) 揭示 tracer 设计的改进方向——区分 `BaseException` 子类（如 `GeneratorExit`, `KeyboardInterrupt`）与 `Exception` 子类（真正的程序错误）可消除此类 irreducible error；(3) 提供 concrete evidence 说明 exception_only 模型\"理解\"的是 `[ERROR]` tag 的 fault indicator 语义，而非 exception type 的 fine-grained 含义。\n\n### D6: Calibration as secondary evidence\nCalibration 数据提供独立于 accuracy 的 evidence dimension。no_trace Brier=0.1972 说明模型无 trace 时不仅预测错，且对错误预测过度自信。exception_only Brier=0.0013 说明模型在有 exception signal 时几乎完美区分确定性和不确定性。这支持 Claim 1 的 \"sufficient signal\" 论点——exception 不仅让模型预测对，还让模型 \"知道自己对\"。\n\n### D7: Early stopping for exception signal (revised — D030 epoch1 data complete)\n3-seed epoch1 完整数据：seed42 epoch1=99.83% → epoch3=99.33%（-0.50pp）；**seed456 epoch1=99.33% → epoch3=99.33%（0.00pp）**；seed123 epoch1=91.43% → epoch3=91.09%（-0.34pp）。**seed42 的 epoch1=99.83%（匹配 Qwen）是该 seed 独有的 LoRA 初始化运气，不是 DeepSeek epoch1 的通用属性。** seed456 epoch1=epoch3 说明 epoch 退化非普遍现象。核心差异仍是 LoRA 初始化（epoch1 起点差 8.40pp），不是 overfitting。Early stopping 无法挽救差的初始化（seed123）。**Implication**: (1) 报告 DeepSeek 结果时应使用 median/2-of-3 (99.33%)，不应以 seed42 epoch1=99.83% 作为 headline；(2) epoch1 peak 是 LoRA 初始化运气的副产物，不具推广性。对比: VOTA 在 DeepSeek 上 84.45% **已确认正确**（D030 关闭: confirmatory re-eval max_length=16384 → 84.45%，与原始训练评估精确一致；D030 根因是 evaluate.py v2 的 max_length=2048 eval-time 截断 bug 导致 82.6% 预测为 garbage tokens）。\n\n### D9: LoRA initialization sensitivity as secondary bottleneck [NEW — D028]\nDeepSeek exception_only seed42=99.83% vs seed123=91.43% (epoch1), 8.40pp gap。Qwen 3 seeds 完全一致。假说：exception signal 的 learnability 取决于 (1) signal 本身的结构简单性（cross-model robust）+ (2) LoRA 初始化是否落入能正确映射 exception→verdict 的 basin。Qwen-7B 可能因模型更强/LoRA landscape 更平滑而对初始化不敏感。DeepSeek-6.7B（CRUXEval-I 39% vs Qwen 56.5%）的 loss landscape 可能更 rugged，LoRA 初始化更易陷入 suboptimal basin（seed123 的 fail_recall 仅 70-72% 说明模型未学到 exception→fail 映射的关键部分）。**论文角度**: 这不是 negative result——它揭示了 trace SFT 的 practical consideration（training stability），可作为 contribution 的一部分。建议 Discussion 讨论 training stabilization 策略（warmup, lr schedule, LoRA rank 调整, multi-seed selection）。\n\n### D10: Train loss ≈ but accuracy ≠ across seeds [NEW — D029]\nDeepSeek exception_only seed456 (train_loss=0.1225) 与 seed123 (train_loss=0.122) 训练损失几乎相同，但 accuracy 差 8.2pp（99.33% vs 91.09%）。关键差异集中在 fail_recall（1.0 vs 0.705）——token-level loss 在所有 tokens 上平均，掩盖了 fail 类少数样本的 sample-level 分类能力差异。**Implication**: (1) 扩展 D1 (eval_loss vs accuracy decoupling) 到训练阶段：train_loss 同样不是 verdict task accuracy 的可靠代理指标；(2) 对 checkpoint selection 的实际建议更强：必须用 task-specific metric (accuracy/F1)，甚至 train_loss 收敛也不保证 task performance；(3) fail 类作为少数类（28.5%），其学习质量被平均 loss 稀释——这在 class-imbalanced 设置下是 general pattern，可推广到其他 verdict/detection 任务。\n\n### D11: VOTA cross-model gap: training-time trace truncation as causal factor [NEW — D030 token analysis + group_analysis]\nD030 token analysis 确认: `to_chat_text()` 保留 labels（verdict label 在训练时未被截断），但 91.7% 的 DeepSeek VOTA 训练样本的 **trace content** 从 mean 2626 tokens 被截断到 ~2048 tokens。\n\n**Group analysis 提供因果证据**: 将测试集按训练截断状态分组（推理时无截断, max_length=16384），train-truncated 组 accuracy=83.04% vs train-intact 组 accuracy=100%, Fisher exact p≈0。**截断的因果方向可以 claim**: 训练时 trace 被截断导致模型学到的信息不完整 → 推理时即使看到完整 trace 也无法正确判断。模型能力差异是残余 confound（无法完全分离）。\n\n**Implications**: (1) 论文中所有 \"right-truncation corrupts/removes the verdict label\" 措辞对 VOTA 不成立——label 完整保留，被截断的是 trace INPUT content；(2) 14.96pp gap 中截断效应有因果证据（group_analysis），模型能力差异是 residual confound；(3) exception_only 因 token 长度短（远低于 2048）不受截断影响，其跨模型对比更 clean——进一步强化 Claim 1 \"most robust component\" 叙事；(4) 论文应讨论 max_length 的影响作为 limitation/future work；(5) group_analysis 数据可作为 Table/Figure 纳入论文——展示截断的因果效应。\n\n### D8: Data duplication as representation signature\nexception_only 训练集 39.45% 重复（4720→2858 unique），测试集 48.99%（1190→607 unique），而 raw_traces 仅 1.81%（5910→5803 unique）。重复源自 exception_only 表征的 design-by-intent compactness：同一编程题的多个 passing 解执行时均无异常，exception_only 表征退化为相同的空标记。这一数据特征本身就是 Claim 3 two-tier hierarchy 的佐证——Tier 1 信号仅编码 fault presence/absence，不编码 solution-level details，因此天然高重复。Train-test input overlap = 0 排除数据泄漏。\n\n## Contingency Framing (已解决, 留存档)\n\n### Claim 1 — RESOLVED (D029: seed456=99.33% confirms \"consistently best component\")\nseed456 与 seed42 完全一致（均 99.33%），seed123 为孤立离群值。Claim 1 定稿为 \"exception events consistently best component across models; absolute performance seed-dependent on DeepSeek (2/3 seeds robust, 1 outlier from LoRA init sensitivity); relative dominance over all alternatives robust across all seeds\"。\"0pp universal gap\" 叙事已放弃，转为数据驱动的 nuanced framing。\n\n### Claim 2 — RESOLVED (D006 + D009)\nv5 full_trace 81.76%. plan_002 label-only 86.22%, gradient dilution = minor (26%). 跨模型 VOTA gap 补充证据.\n\n## 与 v1 Framing 的关键差异\n\n| 维度 | v1 | v2.9 |\n|------|----|----|\n| Headline | VOTA compression 优于 full trace | Exception events are the most effective diagnostic signal |\n| Primary claim | VOTA +24pp through fault indicator preservation | Exception signal consistently best across models; absolute performance seed-dependent on DeepSeek |\n| Claim 2 | Compression > full trace (只有 gradient dilution) | Information density primary + gradient dilution quantification + cross-model reinforcement |\n| Claim 3 Tier 1 | exception_only only | exception + assertion-point (co-Tier 1, D020) |\n| VOTA 定位 | 核心方法 — trace compression | **Fault indicator isolation** — 价值在于提取 exception, 非 generic compression |\n| Model scope | 单模型 (Qwen) | 双模型, 跨模型对比是核心贡献 |\n| DeepSeek full_trace | N/A | v1 collapsed (label truncation), v3 pending |\n| Seed robustness | 未验证 | Qwen ✅ 99.83% ± 0.00 (3 seeds); DeepSeek ⚠️ seed-dependent (91-99%, D028) |\n| Irreducible error | 未分析 | ✅ GeneratorExit 根因明确，99.83% = representation ceiling |\n| Calibration | 未验证 | ✅ 完整 ECE+Brier, ~63x/~150x gap vs no_trace |\n| Data duplication | 未分析 | ✅ exception_only ~40% 重复（representation compactness），train-test overlap = 0 |\n| Early stopping | 未讨论 | DeepSeek epoch1→epoch3 轻微退化 (0.3-0.5pp); 核心问题是 LoRA 初始化 (seed123 epoch1=91.43%), 非 overfitting |\n| Narrative arc | \"VOTA helps\" | \"Exception events are consistently best; VOTA's value is isolating them; training stability matters\" |\n","numLines":298,"startLine":1,"totalLines":298}}}
